  "agartala-tripura-sundari-tour": {
    "overview": "Set out on an adventurous 4 day journey to the Tripura capital, Agartala! While on this trip,See More\n\nyou\u2019ll be spoiled with diverse wildlife, incredible water palaces, and stunning boat rides with a backdrop of sculptures that are centuries old! Moreover, the place is home to one of the Shaktipeeths, making it a powerful worship place for the Shakti devotees. If you want to enjoy a seamless Northeast India tour, then ring us and we\u2019ll offer you our Agartala Tripura Sundari Tour package at the best price. Limited time deal!!\nWhat will you get with this tour plan? Well, consider your hotel booking, meal planning, and transport facilities taken care of. You don't have to worry about these travel logistics anymore. Leave it to our experts, and you\u2019ll have a fantastic time on those eastern lands.  Moreover, with our experienced travel team, you get to enjoy the best itinerary that ensures you travel to maximum places with sufficient time. Call us now to know more about this trip!\nSee Less\n\nyou\u2019ll be spoiled with diverse wildlife, incredible water palaces, and stunning boat rides with a backdrop of sculptures that are centuries old! Moreover, the place is home to one of the Shaktipeeths, making it a powerful worship place for the Shakti devotees. If you want to enjoy a seamless Northeast India tour, then ring us and we\u2019ll offer you our Agartala Tripura Sundari Tour package at the best price. Limited time deal!!\n\nWhat will you get with this tour plan? Well, consider your hotel booking, meal planning, and transport facilities taken care of. You don't have to worry about these travel logistics anymore. Leave it to our experts, and you\u2019ll have a fantastic time on those eastern lands.  Moreover, with our experienced travel team, you get to enjoy the best itinerary that ensures you travel to maximum places with sufficient time. Call us now to know more about this trip!",
    "highlights": [
      "Seek Darshan at the Tripura Sundari Temple",
      "Visit the famous museum Ujjayanta Palace",
      "Darshan at Jagannath, Kasba Kali Bari Temple, and Laxminarayan Temple",
      "Trip to the water palace \u2013 Neermahal Palace",
      "Exploration of the diverse flora and fauna at Sepahijala Wildlife Sanctuary",
      "Witnessing the flag-lowering ceremony at the Indo-Bangla Border",
      "Souvenir shopping at Purbasha Handicrafts Emporium",
      "Boat ride on the Gomati River",
      "Cultural trip to Unakoti and Chabimura Exploration",
      "Trip to Hum Hum Waterfalls",
      "See More"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1: Arrival in Agartala - Ujjayanta Palace - Heritage Park - Indo-Bangla Border",
        "description": "Welcome to Agartala! Our representative will greet you at the airport or railway station. From there, you\u2019ll be taken to your pre-booked hotel.\nCheck in and relax for a while.\nNow, you\u2019ll be taken to the following places:\nUjjayanta Palace\n: It\u2019s a state museum that showcases Tripura\u2019s history and culture.\nJagannath Temple\n: Seek blessings of the lord and also marvel at the beautiful architecture of the shrine.\nLaxminarayan Temple\n: Dedicated to Lord Vishnu, this temple has a very serene and peaceful environment.\nHeritage Park\n: Sit in this park and enjoy the lush greenery that is all around you.\nIndo-Bangla Border\n: You\u2019ll be taken here in the evening, so that you can watch the flag-lowering ceremony.\nReturn to the hotel for an overnight stay.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2: Tripura Sundari Temple - Chabimura Exploration - Souvenir Shopping",
        "description": "Treat yourself to a yummy breakfast.\nNow, you\u2019ll be transferred to Udaipur, where you\u2019ll seek Darshan in the famous\nTripura Sundari Temple\n(Matabari). You also get to feed the fish in the pond here.\nNow, you\u2019ll be taken to the Chabimura Exploration. You can take a boat ride here on the Gomati River to view the exquisite rock-cut sculptures from the 15th century, such as:\nDevi Chakrakma (Mahishasura Mardini Durga)\nChabimura Cave\nNeermahal Water Palace\nSepahijala Wildlife Sanctuary\nOther Carvings, like Panels of Shiva, Vishnu, Kartikeya, and Ganesha\nIn the evening, you\u2019ll be transferred to Agartala.\nNow,\nvisit Purbasha Handicrafts Emporium\n, where you can shop for souvenirs like bamboo, cane, handwoven items, etc.\nReturn to the hotel for the night stay.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3: Trip to Kailashahar",
        "description": "Enjoy a hearty breakfast in the morning\nNow get ready for a trip to Kailashahar, where you\u2019ll visit:\nUnakoti and Heritage Carvings\nHum Hum Waterfalls\nRajkandi Reserve Forest\nReturn to the hotel for a restful night\u2019s sleep.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4: Sightseeing and Departure",
        "description": "Relish a delicious breakfast. And then check out of the hotel.\nNow, get ready for a tour to:\nKamalasagar Lake\nKasba Kali Temple\nNow, you\u2019ll be dropped off at the airport/railway station from where you can continue your journey home. Your trip concludes here!\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      }
    ],
