  "auli-joshimath-devprayag-rishikesh-tour": {
    "overview": "Enjoy a 5 Day spiritual and adventure trip to the captivating mountains of Uttarakhand- Dev Bhoomi. See More\n\nIn our 5-day Devprayag Joshimath Rishikesh Auli Tour, the solace at Panch Prayag intensifies and enriches the soul with positive vibes. It is once in a lifetime opportunity to witness the sacred confluences of holy rivers at Panch Prayag and how is formed. Also elevate your mind, body and soul at the sacred spots in Joshimath. Sooth your senses with the beautiful views in Auli and add thrill to your journey with ski adventures. Don\u2019t miss the fun camping at Shivpuri, thrilling river rafting adventures, cliff jumping and body surfing.Book now to grab this wonderful package to create everlasting fun memories with your loved ones. Don\u2019t worry about any travel logistics. The dedicated team at My Quick Trippers is here to assist you with the best hotels, itinerary, transport, meals and other services at the best price.See Less\n\nIn our 5-day Devprayag Joshimath Rishikesh Auli Tour, the solace at Panch Prayag intensifies and enriches the soul with positive vibes. It is once in a lifetime opportunity to witness the sacred confluences of holy rivers at Panch Prayag and how is formed. Also elevate your mind, body and soul at the sacred spots in Joshimath. Sooth your senses with the beautiful views in Auli and add thrill to your journey with ski adventures. Don\u2019t miss the fun camping at Shivpuri, thrilling river rafting adventures, cliff jumping and body surfing.\n\nBook now to grab this wonderful package to create everlasting fun memories with your loved ones. Don\u2019t worry about any travel logistics. The dedicated team at My Quick Trippers is here to assist you with the best hotels, itinerary, transport, meals and other services at the best price.",
    "highlights": [
      "Spiritual Bliss- Divine Darshan of the holy Panch Prayag. Heal your soul, seek solace at Joshimath\u2019s sacred temples.",
      "Ski Fun- Try exciting ski adventure activities and witness the beauty of awe-inspiring Alaknanda Valley at Auli.",
      "Riverside Camping- Enjoy the stunning views of the beach campsite at Shivpuri with delightful campfire stories and delicious food with your loved ones.",
      "River Rafting Thrill- Enjoy River rafting on Ganga with thrilling rapids. Try cliff jumping and body surfing if you want to add more thrill to your trip.",
      "See More"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1: Arrival in Delhi - Srinagar (320-340 kms/10 Hrs.)",
        "description": "What you\u2019ll Get-\nOur travel representative will pick you up at Delhi airport/ railway station and then you will be driven to Srinagar.\nImportant Stops-\nOn the way, we will explore Devprayag. It is a place where two holy rivers Bhagirathi and Alaknanda meet and merge to form river Ganga.\nWhat to do-\nTaking a holy dip into the Sangam is spiritually enriching. The holy bath is believed to absolve all the sins and karmic backlog of the devotees.\nThereafter, check in to your pre-booked hotel for an overnight stay.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2: Srinagar - Rudraprayag \u2013 Karnaprayag Nandprayag- Joshimath- Auli (150 kms / 7-8 Hrs.)",
        "description": "What you\u2019ll get-\nMorning after breakfast, you will be driven to Auli. It\u2019s a beautiful hill station and one of the\ntop ski resort destinations in India\n. On your way to Auli, enjoy many beautiful scenic spots along the way.\nImportant Stops-\nRudraprayag-\nWitness the beauty of the sacred confluence of Alaknanda and Mandakini River\nKarnaprayag-\nCapture the scenic confluence of Alaknanda and Pindar River\nNandprayag-\nSee the breathtaking confluence of Alaknanda and Nandakini river\nVridha Badri-\nVisit one of the Sapt Badri Temples dedicated to Lord Vishnu.\nJoshimath-\nVisit Joshimath, winter seat of lord Badri. Seek divine blessings.\nAuli-\nEnjoy the scenic beauty of Auli. It\u2019s one of the stunning hill stations to enjoy snow adventure activities.\nThereafter, check into your hotel room for overnight stay at Auli.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3: Auli Skiing Adventure (January to March)",
        "description": "What you\u2019ll get-\nMorning after breakfast, you will witness the breathtaking views of the snowy peaks of Auli and the stunning Alaknanda Valley.\nWhat you\u2019ll do-\nEnjoy a full day ski adventure with your loved ones.\nOptional-\nIf you want to explore nearby scenic spots then you must visit-\nChattrakund-\nSmall scenic lake surrounded with Himalayan mountains and lush greenery.\nSaildhar Tapovan-\nIt is very famous for its hot water springs and sacred temples. You can also buy traditional handicrafts of the region as a souvenir here.\nAuli artificial Lake-\nIt\u2019s a beautiful turquoise lake surrounded by the majestic Himalayan slopes.\nKwani Bugyal-\nEnjoy lush greenery, beauty of snow-laden mountain peaks. It\u2019s a great spot for trekking adventures.\nGorson Bugyal-\nSurrounded by the dense forests of Oak and conifers, you must visit Gorson Bugyal. It\u2019s a nature lover paradise. Also witness the majestic Nanda Devi, Dron and Trishul Parvat.\nAfter\nAuli sightseeing Tour\n, get back to your hotel room for an overnight stay.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4: Auli/ Joshimath Drive. Shivpuri Camping (270 kms/ 8Hrs)",
        "description": "What you\u2019ll get-\nAfter breakfast, we will drive to Joshimath. You will visit some of the most popular\nspiritual spots in Joshimath\nto seek divine blessings.\nImportant Stops-\nNarasimha Temple-\nIt\u2019s a part of\nSapt Badri Temple\ndedicated to the fourth Avatar of lord Vishnu- Lord Narasimha (Half Lion and Half Man)\nBhavishya Kedar-\nVisit this small temple dedicated to Lord Shiva and goddess Parvati. It is believed to be the future home of Kedarnath.\nJyotirmath-\nAlso known as Shri Shankaracharya Math, Jyotirmath is a sanctuary for peace lovers. Get divine blessings of Laxmi Narayan at Laxmi Narayan temple located inside the math.\nAfter\nJoshimath sacred sightseeing tour\n, Drive to Shivpuri to enjoy camping with your loved ones\nAt the camp-\nEnjoy evening tea & snacks, delightful campfire stories, star gazing and delicious food.\nThereafter, overnight stay at the camp. Enjoy a peaceful sleep.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 5: Shiv Puri -Rafting - Delhi 240 Kms (7 Hrs.)",
        "description": "What you\u2019ll get-\nAfter breakfast in the morning, you will prepare to enjoy river rafting on Ganga at Shivpuri.\nWhat to do-\nYou will enjoy river rafting on the Ganga River. Enjoy the fun rapids while you raft down to Rishikesh such as roller coasters, golf course, fire cross, Initiation, Double Trouble.\nFloat past to the temples, ashrams and Ghats. See the slow-paced riverbank life of the Ganges.\nTry body surfing and cliff jumping to add more fun and thrill.\nAfter this thrilling adventure, Prepare for departure. We will drive back to Delhi. You will be transferred to the airport/ railway station for your further journey.\nThe tour ends on a happy note with everlasting memories.\nNote-\nDuring the Sawan month, there will be route diversion on the highway roads like Meerut to\nHaridwar\n, Rishikesh and other places due to the festive occasion of Kanwar Yatra. So have patience and enjoy the journey.\nCaptivate your senses- Click Pictures\nTickle your camera lens to click breathtaking views. Here are some best photography spots-\nGorson Bugyal and Kwani Bugyal-\nThese are stunning meadows surrounded with lush greenery and majestic Himalayan peaks at Auli. Capture Nanda Devi Parvat, Dron Parvat and Trishul Parvat.\nCapture the beautiful confluences of Panch Prayag. Its views are one of a kind.\nShivpuri camping site offers stunning views of lush green beach site. Capture the star laden skies at night.\nCapture scenic Ganga Ghats, ashrams and temple sights. You can also capture video of your rafting and skiing adventures.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
  },
  "auli-skiing-tour": {
    "overview": "What Gulmarg is to Kashmir, Auli is to Uttarakhand? It is the mini Switzerland of this Land of Gods and it is known for being the venue for exciting winter sports. Whereas summer is the best time to visit Uttarakhand\u2019s dozens of destinations, the reverse is true for Auli. In winter the region takes on a mantle of virginal white. It is perfect for skiing. Join NamasteIndiaTrip heavenly skiing experience in Auli spread over 4 nights 3 days.\n\nAuli Skiing Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Rishikesh \u2013 Joshimath\n\n\nArrive in Rishikesh to a warm welcome by our tour guide who escorts you to the waiting coach for the 270 km drive to Joshimath. The 9 hour drive takes you across enchanting countryside, a composition of mountains, valleys and rivers. We drive up to Devprayag where everyone gets down visiting the temple at the confluence. Then we have lunch and proceed to Rudraprayag and finally arrive at Joshimath. What follows next is an experience of heavenly enchantment as the 4 km ropeway ride over magical scenery keeps you enthralled each moment of the way. Check into your hotel room on arrival in Auli and stay overnight in the Cliff Top Resort.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Auli\n\n\nBreakfast and set out to explore Auli on your own. You can join a skiing group, put on Skills and try to ski down gently powdery slopes. It will be a fun experience.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Auli \u2013 Kedarnath\n\n\nBreakfast early and then join the group for the trek to Kedarnath. This is a tough trek over several kilometers of craggy, sloping terrain. Arrive in Kedarnath and check into your hotel and then prepare for the evening Darshan at the famed Kedarnath Temple, site of one of the 12 Jyotirlinga and one of the Four Char Dham. Return, feeling fulfilled, to your hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Auli \u2013 Rishikesh\n\n\nAfter an early morning breakfast, we set out in the coach for the 9 hours 270 km drive to Rishikesh where the tour officially ends. The tour guide helps you onward but you can stay back in Rishikesh if you wish.",
    "highlights": [
      "Experience the heavenly enchantment as the 4 km ropeway ride through magical scenery captivates you every step of the way.",
      "Be a part of the Skiing club in Auli and enjoy the ski",
      "Go for a divine trek to Kedarnath temple Darshan"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Rishikesh \u2013 Joshimath",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2 :Auli",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3 :Auli \u2013 Kedarnath",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4 :Auli \u2013 Rishikesh",
        "description": ""
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
  },
