  "bali-honeymoon-package": {
    "overview": "Bali is a dream destination for couples looking for a romantic honeymoon. This 4-day Bali honeymoon tour package is specially designed for couples who want a mix of romance, relaxation, and a little adventure on their honeymoon.\n\nImagine waking up in a private villa surrounded by palm trees, stunning views, hearing soft ocean waves, and having a floating breakfast just for the two of you. Well, that\u2019s what Bali can bring to the table for couples looking for a memorable romantic honeymoon trip.\nFrom exploring lush green rice terraces to enjoying beachside cafes, from watching stunning sunsets to exploring the key attractions\u2026Bali is full of surprises waiting for you. \nSo let's quickly get in and explore what Bali has got for couples!\n\nImagine waking up in a private villa surrounded by palm trees, stunning views, hearing soft ocean waves, and having a floating breakfast just for the two of you. Well, that\u2019s what Bali can bring to the table for couples looking for a memorable romantic honeymoon trip.\n\nFrom exploring lush green rice terraces to enjoying beachside cafes, from watching stunning sunsets to exploring the key attractions\u2026Bali is full of surprises waiting for you.\n\nSo let's quickly get in and explore what Bali has got for couples!\n\nBali Honeymoon Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 : Arrival in Bali and Check In At Luxurious Resort/Villa\n\n\nYour honeymoon trip will start from Bali Airport (Ngurah Rai International Airport). Our representative will drive you to your hotel/resort (in your preferred location) for a comfortable check-in.\n\nCheck in with a Warm Welcome: Enjoy welcome drinks, a cozy ambience, and a romantic honeymoon room setup.\nSpend Your Day at Your Pace: Take a relaxing walk near your hotel. Enjoy the nearby beach (if staying in a coastal area). Explore caf\u00e9s, local markets, or just relax in your room.\nRomantic Dinner: A romantic candlelight dinner setup just for the lovely couple. Enjoy your dinner alongside a beautiful view, surrounded by palm trees, and peaceful nature.\nOvernight stay at your hotel/resort\n\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 : Visit to Tanjung Benoa Beach\n\n\nStart your morning with a comfortable, delicious breakfast at your hotel. After breakfast, meet your driver, who will take you to explore one of the most exciting destinations of your Bali honeymoon trip.\nTanjung Benoa Beach \u2013 Bali's Watersports Hub\nWitness the stunning views of the Indian Ocean, sandy beaches, crystal clear water, and water sports activities. It is the perfect place for couples to have a mix of fun, excitement, and playful moments together.\nFun Activities for Couples\n\nTandem Parasailing Adventure\nJet Ski Ride\nBanana Boat Fun Ride\nSea Walking\nBali Turtle Park (Optional can be added on request)\n\nLunch\nAfter all the fun, enjoy a relaxing lunch at a nearby restaurant\u2014many offer views of the ocean, giving you a peaceful break.\nRomantic Spa Session (Can be added on request)\n\nYou can also have a couple's spa session.\nBalinese massage, warm oils, soft music, dim lights, and complete relaxation.\nA perfect way to enjoy relaxing moments together.\n\nReturn to the hotel for dinner\nFinally, as the day comes to a close, you'll drive back to your hotel, where a romantic candlelight dinner awaits you for a perfect end to the day.\nHead back, relax, freshen up, and spend quality time together under soft lights, gentle waves, and delicious food.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 : Uluwatu Sightseeing & Kecak Fire Dance Show\n\n\nDay 3 of this honeymoon package is full of culture, cliffs, sunsets, and unforgettable moments in Bali. So, start your day with a delicious breakfast at the hotel. Next, you'll head to South Bali to visit some of the most iconic destinations.\n1. Garuda Wisnu Kencana Cultural Park (GWK)\nThis is one of Bali's most iconic cultural landmarks. This place is a mix of culture, tradition, nature, and some breathtaking views.\nKey Attractions in the Park:\n\nThe massive Garuda Wisnu Kencana statue is considered one of the tallest statues in the world.\nBeautiful Gardens and Pathways - Perfect for clicking couple's photographs\nWatch Cultural Performances, Balinese Music & Artistic Displays\nWalk through famous areas like Lotus Pond, Wisnu Plaza, etc.\n\nEntry Timings: 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM.\nTicket: Approximately IDR 125,000 \u2013 150,000 (\u20b9615 - \u20b91,080)\nAfter spending some time exploring the cultural park, you will head to the next destination. \n2. Visit Uluwatu Temple - The Sunset Point\nReady to experience some breathtaking views from the mountain cliff, and a spiritual experience? Your next stop is the iconic Uluwatu Temple.\n\nThe temple is situated on a 70-meter-high cliff, which offers some stunning views. You can enjoy the beautiful sunset from the top.\nVisit the temple to explore the unique Balinese culture and history\n\nThe temple is open for visitors from 7 AM to 7 PM. You have to pay an entry fee of IDR 50,000.\n3. Watch Kecak Fire Dance Performance\nAs soon as the sun sets you can attend Bali's famous and most iconic dance performances... the Kecak Fire Dance.\nThis is a unique art form, with No Musical Instruments.\nIt is when 50+ men chant \"chak chak chak\" together in a rhythmic manner to create a magical atmosphere. The performance narrates the story of Ramayana.\nPlus, the Fire Dance is one of the thrilling acts of this performance, which will surely make you go wow.\nThis dance performance starts around 6 PM. The ticket price is IDR 150,000 per person, which you can buy from the ticket counter near the temple itself.\nReturn to the Hotel\nAnother day, another experience. After enjoying the beautiful sunset and attending the dance performance, you'll head back to the hotel for the final overnight stay in Bali.\nEnjoy your dinner, and prepare for the last day of your honeymoon trip.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 : Departure from Bali\n\n\nToday is the final day of your honeymoon in Bali.\nBreakfast at the Hotel\nAfter a delicious breakfast at the hotel, you can explore, relax, and make a few more memories before you fly back home.\nVisit Nearby Market\n\nYou can visit the local market\nGo shopping, buy handcrafted souvenirs, Wooden art & decor, couples ornaments\nA walk along the beach\nYou can go to the caf\u00e9 for a quick coffee\nOr have a refreshing coconut drink at the beachside\n\nCheck Out & Drop at Airport\nCome back to the hotel, pack your bags, and check out. Our driver will pick you up from the hotel and drop you safely at the Airport. Sit back, relax, and cherish the moments you created on this unforgettable honeymoon trip.",
    "highlights": [
      "Romantic Villa/Hotel Stays",
      "Sightseeing in Bali",
      "Experiencing local culture and traditions",
      "Visit to Uluwatu Temple and Tanah Lot Temple",
      "Nearby Destinations, Beaches & Cafes",
      "Romantic Candlelit Dinner"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 : Arrival in Bali and Check In At Luxurious Resort/Villa",
        "description": ""
