  "best-of-north-east": {
    "overview": "The hill stations of North East India are undoubtedly enlisted among some of the most preferred and pristine lands around the country where travelers from all across the globe flock. The states of this region in India are inhabited by a handful of population and are reckoned for their rich culture, heritage, art, and the beauty of nature.\n\nNorth East India tour package of My Quick Trippers covers almost every destination falling en-route ranging from Assam to Sikkim to West Bengal. With this 6 nights and 7 days long North East India Tour Package we provide you world-class facilities with this well-designed package that is inclusive of wonderful and relaxing accommodation, proper commutation, meals, and other special requirements (as per your request).\nWhat else to wait for now? Go and grab this exciting deal and give us an opportunity to be your travel guide or companion and we promise you that you are never going to forget this holiday experience.\n\nNorth East India tour package of My Quick Trippers covers almost every destination falling en-route ranging from Assam to Sikkim to West Bengal. With this 6 nights and 7 days long North East India Tour Package we provide you world-class facilities with this well-designed package that is inclusive of wonderful and relaxing accommodation, proper commutation, meals, and other special requirements (as per your request).\n\nWhat else to wait for now? Go and grab this exciting deal and give us an opportunity to be your travel guide or companion and we promise you that you are never going to forget this holiday experience.",
    "highlights": [
      "Tour of the Gangtok city enjoying the old Tibetan culture",
      "Lava and Bishop Excursion",
      "Rumtek Monastery visit",
      "Have a ride in the famous Darjeeling Toy train",
      "Visit the best spots in Darjeeling like visit to the Zoological Gardens and Dhirdham Temple, Happy Valley Tea Estate, Lebong Race Course, Tenzing, Gombu Rock, Peace Pagoda, and Japanese temple, and ride the ropeway for a unique view to enjoy and photograph."
    ],
