        "title": "Day 1: Arrival in Dehradun",
        "description": "One the first day of your Chardham Yatra by Helicopter, you will be arriving at Dehradun and greeted by our tour representative. You will be transferred to your allotted here for an overnight complimentary stay in Dehradun. You shall be staying the night here."
