  "chardham-yatra-from-delhi": {
    "overview": "The Chardhams of Uttarakhand are a must-visit for every devout Hindu. The pilgrimage to the holy Chardhams \u2013 Yamunotri, Gangotri, Kedarnath, and Badrinath \u2013 is believed to grant Moksha, liberation from the cycle of birth and death! Choose our Chardham Yatra Package from Delhi to make your pious journey easier and more comfortable.\n\nWe'll take care of all the logistics for you, like transport, meals, and lodgings! Our Delhi to Chardham Tour is ideal for solo travellers, senior citizens, and couples. Book now!\nLuxury Chardham Yatra Package from Delhi\nOur luxury Chardham tour makes sure you have the spiritual experience of your life! Expect top-class food with premium stays along with transfers in AC cars! To make your journey wholesome as well as winsome, we have included multiple stopovers in your journey to the Chardhams that will add layers to your sacred tour. Moreover, you get to enjoy your journey in the scenic landscapes of the mighty Himalayas.\nWhether it's the leisurely stroll in the countryside of Mana Village or soaking in views of the Kempty Falls in Mussoorie, an idyllic Chardham trip is on the cards. Moreover, enjoy Ganga Aarti at Har Ki Pauri, Darshan at Vishwanath Temple, and stroll at various Ashrams en route to the Char Dham sites. Char Dham tour package starting from Delhi\nWhy Choose the Chardham Travel Package from Delhi?\nBooking a Chardham Yatra from Delhi has various perks. Being the capital, New Delhi offers you various modes of transport for this pilgrimage. Whether you're planning to travel to Chardham from Delhi by road, rail, or plane, Delhi doesn't disappoint as it is well-connected to Chardham by these modes of transport.\nChoosing Delhi as the starting point for the Chardham trip offers you a mix of comfort, convenience, and availability of a wide range of services. Moreover, you get to enjoy picturesque sites on your way to Chardham from the capital.\nOverview of Chardham Yatra Package from Delhi 2026\nWe strive to give you the best of the best experience. Here's a quick overview of your trip with us:\n\n\n\nCategory\nDetails\n\n\n\n\nTemple Visits\n The most important thing in your Chardham Yatra is Darshan at the sacred temples. That\u2019s why we\u2019ll assist you with shrine tours wherever necessary. We\u2019ll take you to the temples in a timely manner early in the morning so that you can do your Darshan, Poojan, Abhishekam, and other rituals. \n\n\nTransportation\n We\u2019ll provide local transport to and from the temples. In addition, we\u2019ll drive you in a private vehicle for sightseeing at various picturesque locations. \n\n\nMeal\n With our Delhi to Chardham Yatra package, you\u2019ll be provided with hygienically prepared delicious meals \u2013 breakfast, lunch, and dinner. \n\n\nLodgings\n We\u2019ll arrange your accommodation as per your budget. From premium stays to humble Dharamshalas, we\u2019ll book your lodgings as per your desire. \n\n\nGuided Tours\n To make your Chardham trip more meaningful, we\u2019ll provide a tour guide, especially at places like Rishikesh. \n\n\nAlluring Stop-offs\n From idyllic Mana Village in Uttarakhand to hill-station-of-dreams Mussoorie, we\u2019ll take you to all the charming locations to enrich your Chardham experience further. \n\n\nAdd-on Experiences\n We\u2019ll stop at Haridwar so that you can take a view of Ganga Aarti and spend some time at the Ghats. Other picturesque stops will be at Rishikesh, Joshimath, Vishnuprayag, and more. \n\n\n\nWhy Choose My Quick Trippers's Chardham Travel Package from Delhi?\nOur Delhi to Chardham tour is ideal for experiencing the sacred journey in the Himalayas. From your food to lodgings, we'll take care of everything for you. Here are a few advantages of doing this holy tour with us:\n\nA to Z Travel Arrangements: With our packages, you don't have to worry about travel logistics at all. We'll arrange food, transport, and accommodation so that you can fully focus on your spiritual Chardham Yatra, as it's supposed to be.\nExpert-Curated Itineraries: Our itineraries are designed by travel industry experts who know what the tour in the hilly area is like. They have curated it such that there's enough room for relaxation between the local trips and also ensured the ascent is at a gradual pace, allowing for proper acclimatization.\nGuided Tours: We also provide experienced guides where it's necessary, like at Rishikesh and other places. The tour guide will give you detailed information about the sites to make your Char Dham Yatra more meaningful as well as enriching.\nAffordable Services: At My Quick Trippers, we pride ourselves on providing class-apart services that also fall within the budget of people. With our tour plans, expect premium services at costs that don't pinch the pocket.\nExperienced Tour Operator: Namaste India has been providing quality tours for about two decades. Being this long in the industry has given us enough experience to understand pilgrims' preferences and requirements, especially for a Chardham tour.\nSo book your New Delhi to Char Dham Yatra Packages with us and bid all tour-related worries goodbye!\n\nGet the Affordable Chardham Package from Delhi\nAt My Quick Trippers, we not only provide class-apart services, we also make sure they are budget-friendly. We offer budget Chardham Yatra Packages from Delhi where you will get picked up in Delhi and taken to the sacred Char Dhams in Uttarakhand. Experience our services complete with a tour guide, delicious vegetarian meals, and a comfortable stay in clean hotels - all in the alluring hilly areas of the Himalayas.\nWith our tour plan, you can experience the divinity of the Char Dhams without draining your financial resources. And at the end, you'll be left mesmerized with a divine, sacred, unparalleled experience.\nBest Time to Do Chardham Yatra\n\nThe best time to go on the Chardham Yatra is in May & June and September & October.\nIn the former, you'll be welcomed with sunny weather as this period marks the summer in the Himalayan regions. And in September and October, the tourists are greeted with hilly verdant valleys and very pleasant, winsome weather. We get the most bookings for our Chardham trip Package from Delhi in this period.\nWe also recommend not going on this trip in the monsoon period as you'll be met with frequent landslides, roadblocks, and heavy rainfall, which will make the temple tours a very difficult task.\n\nStandout Features of Our Char Dham Tour Package Starting from Delhi\n\nAll-Inclusive Plan: Consider your meals, accommodation arrangements, sightseeing, and local transport covered with this tour plan.\nCustomisable Packages: We'll tailor our 4 Dham Package from Delhi as per your needs and budgets. Our highly customizable Char Dham packages are perfect for pilgrims from all walks of life.\nIncredible Prices: We believe in providing quality services at affordable prices. Choose our packages and experience the class-apart services and prices!\n\nTemples Covered in Our Chardham Yatra Package 2026\nTake a look at all the shrines you'll be visiting on your Chardham trip from Delhi:\n\nYamunotri Temple: The shrine marks the beginning of your Chardham Yatra. The temple is dedicated to Goddess Yamuna, the sister of death God. It's believed that her blessings protect the devotees from untimely death.\nGangotri Temple: A symbol of divinity and purity, this temple is dedicated to none other than Goddess Ganga.\nKedarnath Temple: This Chardham temple is also a Jyotirlinga and one of the Panch Kedars. Dedicated to Lord Shiva, this temple is famous for its very tangible spiritual aura.\nBadrinath Temple: The last stop on your Chardham pilgrimage is Badrinath Temple. Dedicated to lord Vishnu, it's part of both the Chhota and Bada Dham circuit!\n\nIn addition, we'll also cover the Vishwanath Temple and Narasimha Temple, among others.\nCancellation Policy\n\nIf a customer cancels the tour within 15 days of the tour commencement, then they are not eligible for a refund.\nIf they cancel the Chardham trip between 15 and 30 days of the trip date, 50% of the package amount will be refunded.\nIf the passenger cancels at least 30 days prior to the trip, then 90% of the cost of the Delhi to Char Dham Yatra Package will be refunded.\nIf due to any unavoidable condition, we can't complete the Chardham trip, we'll attempt the journey the next day. And if for some reason even that is not possible, we'll cancel the tour and refund the unutilized funds, as per our refund policy.\n\nTerms & Conditions\n\nThe private vehicle or other transportation modes will be available to the customer as per the itinerary. It is not available at the passenger's beck and call.\nPassengers are required to make the full payment at least 30 days before the tour commences.\nAny extra expenses like Palki, porter, tips, snacks, and beverages will be the passenger's responsibility. The company won't bear these extra charges.\nOur Chardham Yatra from Delhi will stick to the itinerary and passengers need to comply with it.\nIf for any unforeseeable condition or force majeure situation, the Chardham trip gets extended, then the surplus charges of food and lodgings will be borne by the passenger.\nIf for some unavoidable reason, we can't complete the Chardham tour from Delhi as per the itinerary, then we'll suggest a new itinerary without extending the duration of the trip.\nThe company is not liable if the itinerary gets changed due to unpredictable weather or other situations of similar nature and impact.\n\nPolicy & Terms\n\nIf a passenger wishes to reschedule their Chardham trip, they must inform us at least 15 days prior to the beginning of the tour. We'll book a new tour as per available dates and cancel your previous booking.\nCarefully read our conversations through WhatsApp/mail/SMS. They serve as a part of your contract with us for the Chardham trip.\nKindly be aware that ACs will not work in hilly areas. They might also not work in certain other weather conditions.\nThe company is not liable in case of theft of your property.\nBoth the pick-up and drop-off points are the same.\nThe company is not responsible for situations like death, injury, accident, or other unfortunate events during your Char Dham Yatra from Delhi.\n\nGet the Best Chardham Yatra Package from Delhi NCR with My Quick Trippers\nTake the sacred Chardham Yatra in the Himalayan valleys with the added comfort of our 4 Dham tour from Delhi. Perched in the Garhwal region of the Himalayas, the Char Dhams grant you spiritual peace and divine feeling like no other!\nChoose Chardham Yatra ex Delhi plan and avail the cost-friendly benefits. From comfortable stays to hygienic meals to private vehicle transfers with AC, you can trust us to get the best of the best services on your Chardham trip. From premium stays to luxury services, you can avail of it all with our meticulously created pilgrimage Package.",
    "highlights": [
      "Participate in the grand Ganga Aarti ceremony held at the sacred Ghats in Rishikesh.",
      "Staying in the camps at various destinations falling en-route Char Dham pilgrimage circuit.",
      "Philosophy and offering to Goddess Ganga at Gangotri Shrine.",
      "Visiting Samadhi of Saint Adi Shankaracharya in Kedarnath.",
      "Visiting Mana Village, the last Indian village located on Indo-Tibet border.",
      "Exploring the gorgeous Kempty Falls.",
      "Visiting the huge Yamunotri Temple, Gangotri Temple, Badrinath Temple, and Kedarnath Temple."
    ],
