  "chardham-yatra-package-from-dehradun": {
    "overview": "One of the most sacred pilgrimages in India is the Chardham Yatra of Dehradun that involves visiting the Himalayan temples of Yamunotri, Gangotri, Kedarnath, and Badrinath. This is a complete pilgrimage tour package, which includes start-to-end pilgrimage, comfortable accommodation, picturesque roads, and hassle-free transfers, and all these aimed at completing your spiritual desires. This itinerary is specially designed to suit the needs of travellers starting at Dehradun, Uttarakhand so that the travellers can comfortably reach every dham in time.\n\nWhy Choose Chardham Yatra from Dehradun?\n\nStrategic Starting Point: Dehradun is the closest and cheapest base to the Char Dham circuit due to its proximity to the circuit.\nSmooth Travel Connectivity: Easy accessibility by road and rail ways involving access to major cities of Delhi, Jaipur, and Kolkata.\nBest Seasonal Window: The route is available between April and October, which is a good time of the year, as there is good weather.\nComplete Package: Accommodation, transport, local guide services, and optional helicopter services (e.g. Kedarnath).\n\nChardham Yatra: Best Time to Visit\nThe Chardham Yatra mainly runs from April to October.\nThe most suitable months are May, June, September, and October when the weather is pleasant and the roads are not blocked.\nHealth & Safety Tips\n\nBring high altitude medicine and simple first aid\nWear many clothes as the weather in the mountains is changing\nOnly drink packaged/boiled water\nWear sunscreen and UV protected sunglasses\nStore photocopies and ID evidence",
