  "chardham-yatra-package-from-surat": {
    "overview": "The Chardham Yatra package from Surat allows you to embark on one of the holiest pilgrimages. In Hinduism, the Chardham Yatra is considered to be very important as it attracts thousands of devotees from both India and abroad. This holy pilgrimage gives you a chance to explore four sacred destinations, namely Yamunotri, Gangotri, Kedarnath, and Badrinath. With our tour packages, you can visit the shrines and partake in various sacred rituals.\n\nWith our tour packages, you get the flexibility to choose the type of accommodation you want, activities you want to enjoy, and the kind of amenities you want. Contact us today to book our Chardham packages that cater to those with diverse interests and preferences.\nWhy Choose Namaste India?\nNamaste India is dedicated to crafting itineraries that offer the best value for your money. Each trip is tailored to your preference, ensuring you can have a trip tailored to your preference. We give you the flexibility to choose accommodation and select the duration of the trip. We have crafted thousands of Chardham itineraries in the past and have many satisfied clients who rely on us for all their trips. Whether you're a senior member, a couple, or travelling solo, we offer packages with itineraries that will suit you. Your safety and satisfaction are our prime consideration during the trip.\nOverview of the Char Dham Yatra from Surat Package\nHere's a summary of your trip:\n\n\n\nDetail\nInformation\n\n\n\n\nDestinations Covered\nYamunotri, Gangotri, Kedarnath, and Badrinath\n\n\nBest Time to Visit\nMay to June & September to October\n\n\nYatra Duration\n11 Days / 10 Nights\n\n\nStarting Point\nSurat \u2192 Delhi \u2192 Rishikesh \u2192 Char Dhams\n\n\nModes of Travel\nRoad Travel\n\n\nCost\nINR 42,600\n\n\n\nTypes of Chardham Package from Surat\nTake a look at the Chardham packages we offer.\nLuxury Char Dham Yatra Package from Surat\nOur luxury Chardham Yatra package from Surat is ideal for those looking to enjoy the best amenities and services. This package comes with the best quality hotels, mouth-watering meals, and smooth transportation.\nBudget Char Dham Yatra from Surat\nBudget Chardham Yatra package from Surat caters to all your basic needs. This package includes budget hotels, fuss-free transportation, and vegetarian meals.\nPremium Package\nThe premium package allows you to relish everything at its best. These packages may be costly, but they're worth every penny. From premium accommodation to scrumptious meals and VIP Darshan, you get to enjoy the best amenities with this package.\nHelicopter Package\nHelicopter Chardham Yatra 2026 from Surat allows you to enjoy the aerial views of Uttarakhand's breathtaking landscapes. With the helicopter package, you can visit all four Dhams without worrying about the intricacies associated with the traditional Yatra.\nWhy Book the Char Dham Pilgrimage From Surat?\nSurat has good connectivity with all the major destinations in Uttarakhand, making it an ideal place to start your Chardham Yatra. By flight, you can reach Haridwar or Dehradun and then continue your further journey to the starting point of the Chardham Yatra via road.\nCost of Char Dham Travel Package from Surat 2026\nOur Chardham Yatra Packages price from Surat is INR 42,600. It includes all the basic amenities, including accommodation, meals, transportation, and sightseeing. The cost of the package may vary depending on the season of travel, the kind of experience you want, and the duration of the tour.\nChardham Route Map from Surat\nTake a look at the Chardham route map from Surat.\nSurat \u2192 Delhi \u2192 Haridwar \u2192 Barkot \u2192 Yamunotri \u2192 Uttarkashi \u2192 Guptkashi \u2192 Phata \u2192 Rampur \u2192 Sonprayag \u2192 Gaurikund \u2192 Kedarnath Dham \u2192 Joshimath \u2192 Vishnuprayag \u2192 Badrinath\nBest Time to Visit Chardhams\nLet's take a look at the best time to visit Chardham sites so you can plan your journey in the best way.\nSummer (April - July)\nApril - July is considered to be the best time for a trip to the Chardham sites. During this time of the year, the weather is pleasant with average temperatures rarely going beyond 18 degrees Celsius. You can have Darshan and enjoy sightseeing without any hassle during this time.\nWinter (October - March)\nThis is not a good time for booking the Chardham Yatra package from Surat, owing to the challenging weather conditions. The temperature during this time can drop to as low as -7 degrees Celsius. The roads are closed in this season, and the idols are shifted to their winter destination.\nMonsoon (July - September)\nMonsoon is not a good time for the Chardham Yatra due to the chances of heavy rainfall, which makes trekking very challenging. Road journey should also be avoided due to the chances of a landslide. However, Uttarakhand is shrouded in lush greenery during this time, allowing you to enjoy picturesque views.\nHow to Plan Chardham Yatra from Surat?\nKeep in mind these tips and tricks while planning the Chardham Yatra from Surat.\n\nChoose a trustworthy operator to book the Chardham Yatra package from Surat.\nCheck the itinerary and the inclusions of the package before making the booking.\nRegister yourself for the Chardham Yatra online or offline as per your preference.\nDo not carry alcohol or drugs during the pilgrimage.\nCheck the weather forecast before embarking on the Yatra.\n\nHow to Reach Chardham from Surat?\nOpt for these transportation modes to reach the Chardham sites.\nBy Air\nYou will have to take a flight from Surat to Jolly Grant Airport in Dehradun. From Dehradun, you will have to travel via bus or taxi to Haridwar. From Haridwar, you can reach the Chardham sites' starting point via taxi or cab.\nBy Train\nYou will have to board a train from Surat to Haridwar. Various trains run on this route, including the Yoga Express and the Dehradun Express. From Haridwar, you can reach Rishikesh via a bus or taxi. Rishikesh is considered to be the base for the Chardham Yatra.\nBy Road\nYou will have to reach Delhi from Surat. From Delhi, you can board a bus or taxi to Haridwar or Rishikesh. From Rishikesh, you can take a private vehicle to reach Badrinath and Gangotri.\nTravel Tips for Pilgrims\nThese travel tips will be handy during your trip to the Chardham sites.\n\nMaintain silence and avoid photography inside the temples.\nWear sturdy trekking shoes as you will have to walk a lot during the Chardham Yatra.\nKeep sufficient cash, as digital payment may not be accepted by small vendors.\nCarry all the medications prescribed by your doctor to deal with medical emergencies.\nGive your body some time to catch up to the elevation. For the first few days, take it slow.\n\nAccommodation Options\nTake a look at the accommodation options during your Chardham journey.\nGangotri\nGangotri has both basic and luxury accommodation options for the pilgrims. The recommended options include Hotel Manisha, Himalaya Sadan, and Himalayan Paradise Resort. You can also plan to stay at Harsil and Dharali.\nYamunotri\nYamunotri has both GMVN tourist guest houses and private hotels. If you're on the lookout for luxurious accommodation options, you can plan to stay at Janki Chatti and Hanuman Chatti.\nKedarnath\nKedarnath offers well-maintained and equipped hotels. You can stay at the Himalayan Hills Campsite, Hotel Bhel Ashram, and Sunil Guest House.\nBadrinath\nAt Badrinath, there are both mid-range and budget-friendly hotels. These accommodation options are situated in lush green surroundings, allowing you to enjoy Himalayan views from the window of your hotel.\nWhat to Pack?\nPack these essentials during your Chardham pilgrimage.\nClothing Essentials\n\nWaterproof outer layer.\nThermal gloves, scarf, and hat.\nMoisture-wicking and breathable jacket\nLong-sleeve t-shirt.\n2-3 thermal sets\nDown coats\nWoollen pants\n\nFootwear\n\nLightweight sandals or shoes.\nSturdy trekking shoes.\n\nFirst Aid Kit\n\nPainkiller\nBand aids\nAntiseptic wipes.\nAntiseptic solution\nAntibiotic ointments\nORS Sachets\n\nSnacks\n\nEnergy Bars\nDry fruits\nChocolate\nTrail Mix\n\nBook the Best Chardham Yatra Package from Surat 2026!\nWith the Chardham tour from Surat, you can explore four of the most sacred destinations in India that will fill your lives with prosperity and peace. Commence on this divine Yatra by contacting our experts today!",
