  "charming-madhya-pradesh": {
    "overview": "The state of Madhya Pradesh is guarded by Rajasthan, Gujarat, Maharashtra, Uttar Pradesh and Chhattisgarh, making it a land-locked state. However, it has a lot to boast in terms of its natural beauty and historical significance.\n\nMadhya Pradesh never falls short of tourist spots with majestic temples, historical monuments, hill resorts, amazing waterfalls and the enticing national parks and wildlife sanctuaries that are filled with flora and fauna of a wide variety. The kingly appearance of the monuments, in terms of architecture, stand as witness to the artistic taste of the royalty, for which this land was once well-famed. Its medieval charm is felt in all the ancient marvels that still survive in various parts of the state. You can also opt to visit the various sacred centres like the Udaipur, Orchha and Bhojpur temples which offer spiritual as well as artistic relief. Plan a tour to Madhya Pradesh for a complete holiday package.\nAbout The Package:\nThe \u201cCharming Madhya Pradesh\u2019 tour package arranged by My Quick Trippers consists of all the elements required for a holiday including visit to the ancient structures and enjoying scenic views that display the geographic beauty of the land. The exotic landscape and the medieval period structures will all be part of this tour. The most prominent site will be the national park visit where you will come face to face with the wildlife of the region that give you pleasure which cannot be expressed with words. Different scenic beauties like gorges and valley can be enjoyed all through the trip. You will also come across the Marble Rocks and other monuments during the tour which will make the trip more exciting. My Quick Trippers ensures through its professional excellence that its customers get the most fun out of any trip without any bumps along the way. So, book right away to enjoy an adventurous trip to Charming Madhya Pradesh for a full-fun package.",
    "highlights": [
      "Visit the famous Bhedaghat from Jabalpur to see the Marble rocks",
      "Jabalpur sightseeing",
      "Enjoy the Bandhavgarh wildlife",
      "Pay a visit to the Kanha National Park",
      "Mesmerize yourself in the picturesque nature"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
