  "cheap-thailand-tour": {
    "overview": "Check out our most customized Best of Thailand Tour Package and get to know about the rich culture and relax along the white sandy beaches and the tropical islands. Thailand is the country which offers the beauties of these worlds. Read the complete itinerary and get amazed with the peaceful and the elegant Buddha Temples and stroll along the exotic beaches in Thailand where you can have a great time with your family and friends.\n\nCheap Thailand Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Bangkok \u2013 Pattaya\n\n\nWelcome to the magical land of Thailand! Upon your arrival in Bangkok drive towards Pattaya and cover 2 km long distance to Pattaya. On reaching the destination city check-into the hotel room and then in the evening get yourself dressed up nicely as you are going to witness the charm of Alcazar Show organized on a huge level. This show is going to be a full entertainment package with dance performances, Music Shows, Kids Shows, and light and sound show. Move back to the hotel after this show and treat your taste buds with lip-smacking Thai cuisine in dinner followed by a relaxing overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Pattaya \u2013 Coral Island\n\n\nNo need to be in a hurry as the second day of the trip is scheduled for a half-day trip to hop on the Coral Island. Get transferred to the Island after a healthy lunch and indulge yourself in water sport activities like underwater walk, parasailing, etc. to add more fun to your tour with speed boat transfer and then later in the evening make yourself feel relaxed.\nNote: These activities are done on a direct payment basis by you as this is not included in the itinerary.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Pattaya \u2013 Bangkok\n\n\nOn the third day of the journey, you will be driving towards the capital city of Thailand where you can explore numerous temples, shopping places, and various spots to indulge in leisure activities. Once you are done with the temple tour of the city, go to the shopping areas and buy some souvenirs for your family and friends. Make an overnight halt at your pre-decided hotels in Bangkok.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Bangkok\n\n\nNo need to be in a hurry as the second day of the trip is scheduled for a half-day trip to hop on the Coral Island. Get transferred to the Island after a healthy lunch and indulge yourself in water sport activities like underwater walk, parasailing, etc. to add more fun to your tour with speed boat transfer and then later in the evening make yourself feel relaxed.\nNote: These activities are done on a direct payment basis by you as this is not included in the itinerary.\n\n\n\n\nDay 5 :Departure from Bangkok\n\n\nPost serving your taste buds with mouth-watering breakfast at the hotel, get your baggage ready and complete the check-out formalities at the hotel before you leave for the airport for boarding your flight. Our representative says goodbye with your arrival at Bangkok Airport.",
    "highlights": [
      "Participate in the Alcazar Show as an audience.",
      "Visiting the Coral Island and enjoy the exciting speed boat ride.",
      "Visiting the Gems Gallery and spot the exotic collection of the valuable gems.",
      "City and the temple tour in Bangkok."
    ],
    "itinerary": [
