  "explore-enchanting-tamilnadu": {
    "overview": "With its enticing blend of historical splendour, colour, and modernity, the Indian state of Tamil Nadu enchants all of its tourists. There are a good number of tourists who come to Tamil Nadu each year, one of India\u2019s most popular tourist destinations. In fact, visiting Tamil Nadu\u2019s fantastic tourism attractions is considered essential to any vacation to South India.\n\nA trip to Tamil Nadu in India is sure to astound visitors with a multitude of unanticipated attractions, from gorgeous beaches to ancient temples. Tamil Nadu\u2019s fascinating past is intermingled with its numerous tourism attractions. Tourists are constantly observed savouring every detail that locals or tour guides offer. With our 7 Days/ 6 Nights tour package you can explore Tamil Nadu in an intricate manner.\n\nA trip to Tamil Nadu in India is sure to astound visitors with a multitude of unanticipated attractions, from gorgeous beaches to ancient temples. Tamil Nadu\u2019s fascinating past is intermingled with its numerous tourism attractions. Tourists are constantly observed savouring every detail that locals or tour guides offer. With our 7 Days/ 6 Nights tour package you can explore Tamil Nadu in an intricate manner.\n\nEnchanting Tamil Nadu Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Chennai Arrival\n\n\nOur representative meets and welcomes you on your arrival to Chennai Railway station/Airport. Later our representative assists you to transfer to Cochin Hotel. Later visit Kapaleeswarar Temple and Ashtalakshmi Temple, evening free to Explore the beaches, Overnight stay at the hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Chennai \u2013 Tirupati\n\n\nThe morning after breakfast drive to Mahabalipuram visit Crocodile Farm and Dakshinachitra (Craft village). Visit Shore Temple (UNESCO World Heritage site) and other heritage sites (Pancha Ratha, Varaha Cave Temple, Tiger Cave, Krishna Mandapam, Balancing rock, Arjuna\u2019s Penance, all within 1-2 km radius) in the evening. Overnight in Mahabalipuram.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Mahabalipuram \u2013 Tanjore\n\n\nAfter breakfast drive to Tanjore, upon arrival, check in at the prebooked hotel then explore the local tourist attractions which include Brihadeeswara temple, Nandi temple and the Royal Palace complex. Overnight in Tanjore.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Tanjore \u2013 Trichy \u2013 Madurai\n\n\nMorning Proceed to Madurai on the way visit Trichy where you see the Rock Fort Temple, Jambukeshwara Temple and Srirangam Temple. Now proceed to Madurai. On arrival check in at the hotel. Later explore the marvelous temples and other attractions of this city. The famous places you will visit here include Meenakshi Amman temple, Gandhi Museum and Thirumalai Nayak Palace. Drive back to the hotel. Overnight in Madurai.\n\n\n\n\nDay 5 :Madurai \u2013 Rameshwaram\n\n\nAfter breakfast at the hotel. Drive towards Rameshwaram. On arrival check in at the prebooked hotel then go for city tour covering the sightseeing of the most famous attraction of this place is Rameshwaram temple, a prominent Jyotirlinga of Lord Shiva. Other temples you will visit here include Ramjharoka Temple, Kothandaramaswamy Temple and Ramanathaswamy Temple. Stay overnight at the hotel in Rameshwar.\n\n\n\n\nDay 6 :Rameshwaram \u2013 Kanyakumari\n\n\nToday, after breakfast at hotel leave for Kanyakumari, it is the city where you can witness the confluence of three mighty water bodies- Arabian Sea, Indian Ocean and the Bay of Bengal. The famous places you will visit here include Vivekananda Rock Memorial, Suchindram Temple, Kanyakumari Temple and the Gandhi Mandapam. Enjoy Sunset of Kanyakumari from the tip of India, overnight at Hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 7 :Kanyakumari \u2013 Trivandrum\n\n\nDeparture Early morning enjoy the sunrise on the beach. After breakfast transfer to Kanyakumari Trivandrum Airport/ Railway Station for Journey to onwards Destination. Thank you for your patronage and looks forward to serving you again in the near future.",
    "highlights": [
      "Visit to the famous Shore Temple, (UNESCO world heritage site)",
      "Be a part of history with the Nandi temple",
      "Also added in the tour are the Meenakshi temple of Madurai and Rameshwaram temple, one of the Jyotirlingas",
      "Visit to the famous Vivekananda Rocks in Kanyakumari, which is at the tip of India"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Chennai Arrival",
        "description": ""
      },
