  "fascinating-eastern-himalaya": {
    "overview": "My Quick Trippers is offering you an exciting deal on an Eastern Himalayan tour to see the star attractions of the Eastern Himalayas in only nine days.\n\nBrowsing this 8 nights and 9 days long Eastern Himalaya tour package provides you ample opportunity to explore the unmatched wonders of the eastern states, snow-clad mountain peaks, architectural wonders, and above all tranquility and serenity spread everywhere.\nOn this 9 days long trip with us, you get to explore the magnificent Tiger Hill which is reckoned for witnessing the glory of sunrise and its amazing effect on Ghoom Monastery, Kanchenjunga, War Memorial, and the Batasia Loop. Opting for this meticulously crafted tour package avails you with proper transportation, clean and hygienic accommodation (as per your request), mouth-watering meals, and other basic amenities.\nKeep scrolling down the pages to know the detailed information about your trip through this beautifully crafted itinerary. Check out the places you are going to cover and what are the inclusions and exclusions of the package and also the terms and conditions of cancellation policies.\n\nBrowsing this 8 nights and 9 days long Eastern Himalaya tour package provides you ample opportunity to explore the unmatched wonders of the eastern states, snow-clad mountain peaks, architectural wonders, and above all tranquility and serenity spread everywhere.\n\nOn this 9 days long trip with us, you get to explore the magnificent Tiger Hill which is reckoned for witnessing the glory of sunrise and its amazing effect on Ghoom Monastery, Kanchenjunga, War Memorial, and the Batasia Loop. Opting for this meticulously crafted tour package avails you with proper transportation, clean and hygienic accommodation (as per your request), mouth-watering meals, and other basic amenities.",
