  "goa-tour-package-5-days": {
    "overview": "Browse our well-thought-out 5-day Goa tour package that aims to provide travel enthusiasts with an ideal mix of comfort, leisure, and experiential journeys.See More\n\nAll your needs will be arranged, starting with your arrival to the end of your stay, including transfers, accommodation, breakfast every day, and guided services. The package guarantees a hassle-free trip where one can just sit back and experience the laid-back Goa. It will be a balanced itinerary which will include sightseeing and cultural glimpses combined with leisure time and optional activities.\nThe evenings are also strategically maintained free, and therefore you can just sample the lively nightlife in Goa, or you can just relax at the beach. One of the greatest features of the package is the Mandovi River Cruise included, which provides you with an opportunity to enjoy the beautiful scenery in a different manner. The plan is flexible enough to suit you, whether you would rather relax in your resort, take a personal Ayurvedic therapy session, go shopping, or rent a bike and cycle through the city. \nOur representatives are quite experienced and help make your holiday as valuable as possible with local suggestions of where to dine, shop, and things to do. Our holiday deals are designed to match the travel preferences of every age group. In simple terms, it is suited to all those who desire to have a lifetime cherishing holiday without worrying about arrangements and planning.\nSee Less\n\nAll your needs will be arranged, starting with your arrival to the end of your stay, including transfers, accommodation, breakfast every day, and guided services. The package guarantees a hassle-free trip where one can just sit back and experience the laid-back Goa. It will be a balanced itinerary which will include sightseeing and cultural glimpses combined with leisure time and optional activities.",
    "highlights": [
      "Unmatched nightlife and seafood at the beaches.",
      "North Goa beaches.",
      "Tour of famous Fort Aguada (only if time allows).",
      "South Goa tours: Miramar beach, Old Goa churches, and Basilica of Bom Jesus.",
      "Religious tour to Mangeshi Temple.",
      "Sightseeing of the mesmerizing scenic Mandovi River Cruise.",
      "Free time that can be spent either shopping, biking, or Ayurvedic treatment.",
      "Sightseeing trip around a local beach and the sunset.",
      "Stress-free airport transfers.",
      "See More"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1: : Goa Arrival",
        "description": "Welcome to Goa, the city of beaches. Upon your arrival at the railway station or airport, you will get to meet our representative, who will then escort you to the pre-booked hotel.\nUpon arrival at your stay, complete the check-in process and take a rest.\nIn the evening, drive towards the nearest beach to enjoy the city's nightlife and seafood. Come back to the hotel and enjoy a relaxing overnight stay.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2: North Goa Exploration",
        "description": "Post enjoying the morning meal, get ready to enjoy the sightseeing activities in North Goa.\nToday, you will be witnessing the impeccable beauty of several beaches like:\nVagator\nAnjuna\nCalangute\nIf time allows, then don\u2019t miss the chance to visit Fort Aguada. Our representative can suggest some best places to enjoy dinner in North Goa.\nP.S. Don\u2019t miss the chance to try some authentic Goan dishes like Fish Curry, Vindaloo, Bebinca, and Feni (local spirit).\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3: South Goa",
        "description": "Start your day a little early, as you will be exploring the southern side of Goa. South Goa boasts numerous sightseeing sites which attract millions of Indian as well as foreign tourists.\nMiramar Beach\nOld Goa churches\nBom Jesus Basilica\nAlso, if you want to feel some spiritual vibes here, then you must visit the Mangeshi temple.\nGlide across the shimmering river Mandovi on a dreamy boat cruise and make some realistic videos to post on your social media platforms.\nOne must be tired by now; hence, return to the hotel and enjoy a deep sleep.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4: In Goa",
        "description": "Post a relishing and healthy breakfast, you can either spend your day in the hotel or resort till afternoon, or rent a bike and enjoy shopping.\nYou can also opt for Ayurvedic Therapy to feel relaxed and rejuvenated. The therapy is done using herbs instead of chemical-based medicines and oils.\nEnjoy the sunset and lip-smacking seafood at the nearest beach to your hotel. Later, come back to your stay for a relaxing overnight stay."
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 5: Departure from Goa",
        "description": "Finally, it\u2019s time to say goodbye to this beautiful beach city. You can start your day a little late, as there is no schedule for today.\nFinish your breakfast first and then complete the check-out formalities.\nOur tour representative will pick you up from there and drop at the railway station or airport.\nWe hope you had a great vacation in Goa with us. Have a happy and safe journey back home."
      }
    ],
