  "jorhat-majuli-kaziranga-tour-package": {
    "overview": "Travel straight to the heart of Assam with this 5-day Jorhat Majuli Kaziranga Tour Package! In this trip, you\u2019ll get to be up close with Assam\u2018s culture. See More\n\nWhether it\u2019s the unique cuisine or its culture reflected through art performances & the ancient craft techniques dating back centuries, this eastern land never leaves a single soul untouched! And that\u2019s not all \u2013 the place has a regal touch to it. From its colonial bungalows to charming tea estates, there\u2019s really a lot to be amazed with!\nAnd just when you think your trip can\u2019t get any better, we\u2019ll take you to the best wildlife adventure.  Enter Kaziranga National Park, a place that boasts of a high density of tigers and the endangered one-horned rhinoceros! Enjoy elephant safaris, jeep safaris, or both \u2013 you\u2019re in for the time of your life. Moreover, the stunning Orchid Park here will give you enough photo ops to flaunt the pictures on your stories! By the way, our well-crafted itineraries are ideal for a trip down here and see the best of the best that this place has to offer. Wait no more, call us now and set out on this one-of-a-kind trip!\nSee Less\n\nWhether it\u2019s the unique cuisine or its culture reflected through art performances & the ancient craft techniques dating back centuries, this eastern land never leaves a single soul untouched! And that\u2019s not all \u2013 the place has a regal touch to it. From its colonial bungalows to charming tea estates, there\u2019s really a lot to be amazed with!\n\nAnd just when you think your trip can\u2019t get any better, we\u2019ll take you to the best wildlife adventure.  Enter Kaziranga National Park, a place that boasts of a high density of tigers and the endangered one-horned rhinoceros! Enjoy elephant safaris, jeep safaris, or both \u2013 you\u2019re in for the time of your life. Moreover, the stunning Orchid Park here will give you enough photo ops to flaunt the pictures on your stories! By the way, our well-crafted itineraries are ideal for a trip down here and see the best of the best that this place has to offer. Wait no more, call us now and set out on this one-of-a-kind trip!",
    "highlights": [
      "Enjoy a luxe stay in a colonial tea bungalow",
      "Go for a tea tasting tour",
      "Enjoy an over-hour-long ferry ride to Majuli",
      "See monasteries, tribal villages, and ancient mask-making techniques",
      "Enjoy Elephant Safari and Jeep Safari in Kaziranga National Park",
      "Spot one-horned rhinoceros, tigers, and various other animals",
      "Get in awe of rich flora at Kaziranga Orchid & Biodiversity Park",
      "Watch Assam\u2019s authentic cultural dance performances"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1: Arrival in Jorhat \u2013 Tea Tasting Tour \u2013 Museum & Temple Visit",
        "description": "Welcome to Jorhat! Our team representative will greet you at the Jorhat airport or railway station.\nAfterwards, you\u2019ll be transferred to your\ncolonial-era tea bungalow.\nEnjoy its historical vibe!\nYou can also go for a tea tasting tour (direct payment basis).\nNow, you\u2019ll be taken on a small sightseeing tour which will introduce you to the Assamese rich culture. You\u2019ll be visiting:\nThengal Cultural Centre & Museum\nDhekiakhowa Bornamghar\nReturn to the hotel for an overnight stay.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2: Majuli Trip",
        "description": "Enjoy a delicious breakfast.\nThen get ready for a\nferry journey to Majuli\nacross the Brahmaputra River!\nGet immersed in the island\u2019s unique culture with visits to:\nAuniati Satra & Garmur Satra\n(Assamese art and artifacts)\nSamaguri Satra\n(Witness traditional mask-making)\nMising Tribal Villages\n(Watch the traditional handloom weaving techniques)\nEnjoy an overnight stay in Majuli.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3: Trip to Kaziranga National Parka",
        "description": "Relish a nice breakfast.\nNow, go for bird\nwatching in Majuli\u2019s wetlands.\nAfterwards, take a ferry ride back to Jorhat.\nYou\u2019ll be driven to the\nKaziranga National Park\nnow!\nOnce you arrive, check in and take some time to relax.\nIn the evening, treat yourself to a\ntraditional Assamese dance performance.\nEnjoy an overnight stay in Kaziranga.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4: Explore Kaziranga Park",
        "description": "Have breakfast, and get ready for wildlife adventures in the park!\nYou\u2019ll get to enjoy:\nElephant Safari\nKaziranga Orchid & Biodiversity Park\nJeep Safari\nEnjoy yet another night at the Kaziranga resort.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 5: Departure from Guwahati",
        "description": "Savour a delicious meal in the morning.\nNow, you\u2019ll be transferred to the Guwahati airport/railway station, depending on your preference. This concludes your trip!"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
  },
