  "kailash-mansarovar-yatra-form-nepalganj": {
    "overview": "The path to God-realization melts away one\u2019s sense of \u2018I\u2019, ego-consciousness, to enable one being an empty receptacle to receive the Divine.\n\nWhereas arduous treks to summits and inaccessible regions inflate one\u2019s sense of self by adding to it the honor of accomplishment, pilgrimages that are equally difficult to endure intend to wither away one\u2019s egoic self, thereby taking the human soul closer to its impregnation by the Divine. Few pilgrimage trajectories in the modern age carry with them the hallmark of being \u2018arduous\u2019, and of the ones that still do, Kailash Mansarovar Yatra from Nepalgunj is deemed the most holy.\nMount Kailash is considered to be the abode of Lord Shiva, the primordial persona of Divine Masculine, whose witness consciousness pervades the entirety of cosmos, which in itself is a playground for Shakti, the Divine Feminine, to engage in her manifold manifestations of Maya. My Quick Trippers Pvt. Ltd brings to you the best and most well-tailored itinerary to encompass the sanctity of Kailash Yatra in 10 days and 9 nights.\n\nWhereas arduous treks to summits and inaccessible regions inflate one\u2019s sense of self by adding to it the honor of accomplishment, pilgrimages that are equally difficult to endure intend to wither away one\u2019s egoic self, thereby taking the human soul closer to its impregnation by the Divine. Few pilgrimage trajectories in the modern age carry with them the hallmark of being \u2018arduous\u2019, and of the ones that still do, Kailash Mansarovar Yatra from Nepalgunj is deemed the most holy.",
    "highlights": [
      "Visit the UNESCO World Heritage Site Pashupatinath Temple Complex",
      "Visit the Shiva temple at Simikot",
      "Purang sightseeing",
      "Finally visit to the Mansarovar lake for the Parikrama also you can take a holy dip in the Sarovar",
      "At Darchen the base of Mount Kailash where you can go for local souvenir shopping or taste the local cuisines",
      "Visit to the famous Yam Dwar",
      "Trek to the Dolma-La Pass",
      "Complete the Kailash Parikrama"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Arrive Lucknow - Nepalgunj (185.5 km / 4h 6min)",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2 :Nepalgunj - Simikot (216 km)",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3 :Simikot - Hilsa - Purang (621 km)",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4 :Purang",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 5 :Purang - Mansarovar (4580m)",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 6 :Mansarovar - Darchen",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 7 :Darchen - Driaphuk (4890m)",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 8 :Driaphuk - Zuthulphuk (4790m)",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 9 :Zuthulphuk - Hilsa - Simikot",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 10 :Simikot - Nepalgunj",
        "description": ""
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
  },
