  "karnataka-tour-package": {
    "overview": "Karnataka situated in the country\u2019s southwest has a diverse terrain and rich cultural heritage making it a wealthy state. Enormous palaces, beaches and hill stations will surely fascinate you it draws adventure seekers as well as people who enjoy sightseeing. The historic Vijayanagara Empire is one indication of its great past, which is seen in the forts, palaces, and old settlements that make up the region. But Karnataka\u2019s appeal also extends to its hill stations, including Chikmagalur, serene, laid-back beaches, and temples like Virupaksha and Vitthala, which serve as reminders of the past\u2019s architectural excellence. So with our 5 days / 4 nights tour package enjoy a luxurious vacation in Karnataka with the niche touch of treat, adventures, sightseeing, and amusement.\n\nBest of Karnataka Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Mysore Arrival\n\n\nWelcome to Mysore, You are greeted on arrival at Mysore Railway station/Bus Stand by My Quick Trippers representative and Transfer to Hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Coorg Sightseeing\n\n\nBreakfast at the hotel. Morning, after breakfast, you may opt to go for a sightseeing tour of Coorg visiting Madikeri Fort, Raja Seat. At Raja Seat enjoy the spectacular sunset which will refresh one\u2019s mind. Overnight stay at the hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Coorg \u2013 Madikeri\n\n\nBreakfast at the hotel. Today either you may opt to relax at the resort or go for a full day sightseeing tour in and around Madikeri visiting Talakaveri, Nisargadhama, Tibetan Monastery and the Harangi Dam. Overnight stay at the hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Coorg to Nagarhole (74 Kms / 2 Hrs Drive)\n\n\nAfter breakfast, drive to Kabini or popularly known as Nagarhole famous for Rajiv Gandhi National Park. On arrival, check in at the Hotel. Evening you may opt to have a guided safari through the National park. Overnight at the Hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 5 :Nagarhole to Bangalore (220 Kms / 5 Hrs)\n\n\nYou will be dropped to Bangalore to connect your onward journey.",
    "highlights": [
      "Visit to the famous Madikeri Fort in Coorg",
      "Coorg exciting Sightseeing",
      "Feel the touch of divinity at the Tibetan Monasty",
