  "kaziranga-tour-package": {
    "overview": "Welcome to the Kaziranga National Park! If you\u2019re into wildlife even remotely, then you must come here. See More\n\nNot only do you get to see the elusive one-horned rhinoceros, you get to enjoy a myriad of other things, like bird watching, jungle safaris, spotting tigers, and serene landscapes that this place is just naturally blessed with! And if you want to have a seamless journey here, simply book our Kaziranga Tour Package!\nWith our well-planned itinerary, you get to see the best and most of the park in optimum time. In addition, we\u2019ll also introduce you to the Assamese culture with the delightful cuisine and cultural insights. So what are you waiting for? Contact us now so that we can plan this exciting wildlife adventure for you!\nSee Less\n\nNot only do you get to see the elusive one-horned rhinoceros, you get to enjoy a myriad of other things, like bird watching, jungle safaris, spotting tigers, and serene landscapes that this place is just naturally blessed with! And if you want to have a seamless journey here, simply book our Kaziranga Tour Package!\n\nWith our well-planned itinerary, you get to see the best and most of the park in optimum time. In addition, we\u2019ll also introduce you to the Assamese culture with the delightful cuisine and cultural insights. So what are you waiting for? Contact us now so that we can plan this exciting wildlife adventure for you!\n\nTour Gallery\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTour Name\nKaziranga National Park Tour Package\n\n\nTour Duration\n03 Days / 02 Nights\n\n\nMeals\nBreakfast & Dinner\n\n\nVehicle Type\nSedan / SUV\n\n\nStarting & Ending Point\nGuwahati\n\n\nDestination Covered\nGuwahati - Kaziranga National Park\n\n\nPickup Time\nDepend on your Flight Timing \n\n\n Tour Benefits\nBest price & enjoyable travel guarantee",
    "highlights": [
      "Visit to the Kaziranga National Park and spot the endangered one-horned rhinoceros",
      "Enjoy both the Elephant Safari and Jeep Safari",
      "Spot tigers as the park boasts of their high density",
      "Travel to various different zones inside the park",
      "Exploration of the Kaziranga Orchid and Biodiversity Park",
      "Relish the authentic Assamese cuisine",
      "Spiritual visit to the Maha Mrityunjay Temple"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1: Arrival in Guwahati\u202fand Trip to Orchid and Biodiversity Park",
        "description": "Welcome to Guwahati. Our team rep will meet you at the Guwahati airport/railway station.\nNow, you\u2019ll be transferred to your hotel. Check in!\nIn the evening, you\u2019ll be taken to the\nOrchid and Biodiversity Park.\nYou can explore here:\n600+ species of wild orchids\nRice museum\nFish pond\nFlower garden\nAlso, partake in the delicious Assamese cuisine.\nReturn to the hotel for an overnight stay.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2: Elephant and Jeep Safari in Kaziranga Park",
        "description": "Wake up early in the morning to go on the\nelephant safari\nin the Kaziranga National Park. You\u2019ll be informed a day before whether you\u2019ll be visiting the Bagori, Central, or Eastern zone.\nNow is your chance to spot the famous one-horned rhinoceros.\nAlso, enjoy other animals here like tigers, wild elephants, deer, etc. Also, het delighted with a variety of bird species here.\nAfterwards, you\u2019ll be transferred back to the hotel for breakfast and some relaxation.\nNow, you\u2019ll be driven back to the Kaziranga\u202fPark for a thrilling\njeep safari.\nThis time you\u2019ll be traversing a completely different zone.\nReturn to the hotel and get a restful night\u2019s sleep.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3: Temple Visit and Departure",
        "description": "Treat yourself to a hearty breakfast.\nNow, you\u2019ll be driven to the\nMaha Mrityunjay Temple,\nwhich is located near Nagaon.\nEnjoy a brief stopover for lunch.\nNow, you\u2019ll be transferred to the airport/railway station from where you can start your journey home."
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
  },
