  "kovalam-ayurveda-tour": {
    "overview": "The best healthcare system in the world, Ayurveda, and the study of life and aging were developed in the pure and ideal nation of India about 5000 years ago. It combines the two essential elements of theory and recommendation. The healthy physical, mental, and spiritual development of people has long been supported by Ayurveda. The conclusion of your body\u2019s three Doshas-Vata, Pitta, and Kapha depends on this exceptional, vital element of contemporary medicine in order to achieve the proper parity. In this 8 days / 7 nights tour your body and mind would be rejuvenated with the Ayurvedic massages.\n\nKovalam Ayurveda Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Trivandrum to Kovalam\n\n\nThe My Quick Trippers representative will receive you at Trivandrum and escort you to the \u2018Ayurvedic Resort\u2019 at Kovalam for check-in. After some rest you can consult with the Ayurvedic physician for expert advice. Spend the leftover day at this resort and rest here for the night.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :At Kovalam\n\n\nStart your day 2 with meditation and yoga session and for rejuvenating the body, soul and mind you can opt for an \u2018Ayurvedic rejuvenating\u2019 massage. Spend the afternoon in your own way. Overnight take rest and enjoy a good night sleep at the resort.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Kovalam Continued\n\n\nDay 3 is booked with another meditation and yoga session. Later in the day you can opt for another \u2018Ayurvedic massage for livening up your tired body. After lunch you can take a tour of the city. Spend the night at the resort.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Kovalam Continued\n\n\nOn day 4 you will be given another meditation and yoga session followed by the ayurvedic massage. The afternoon is free for you to relax. In the evening take a cruise on the boat to enjoy the backwaters of Thiruvallam. While returning to the resort, visit a traditional home in Kerala to learn about their lifestyle. Spend the night at the resort.\n\n\n\n\nDay 5 :Kovalam Continued\n\n\nDay 5 again starts with meditation and yoga massage after which you will be given an ayurvedic massage. Spend the afternoon in your own way. Visit Kalari in the evening which is popular as a body and health care center in this state. Get back to the resort for overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 6 :Kovalam Continued\n\n\nOn the morning of day 6 you will be exposed to one more meditation and yoga session followed by another ayurvedic massage. In the afternoon you will be taken to the Cape Comorin for a visit (this is Kanya Kumari\u2019s traditional name). Enjoy the amazing sunset in the place. Get back to the resort for dinner and night stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 7 :Kovalam Continued\n\n\nDay 7 will be the same as day 6 with morning meditation and yoga session followed by the Ayurvedic massage. Later on in the day you can spend time at the beach for fun activities. Walk along the sandy beach and enjoy your time here. Return to the resort for dinner and night stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 8 :Return Home\n\n\nOn the final day you will be escorted by the My Quick Trippers representative to the Trivandrum airport for flying back home.",
    "highlights": [
      "Full massage package at Kovalam Ayurvedic center",
      "Meditation and Yoga sessions",
      "Healthy and balanced food keeping the taste alive",
      "Relaxing the body and soul"
    ],
