  "madhya-pradesh-wildlife-tour": {
    "overview": "Your wildlife tours will take you from Keoladeo National Park, a World Heritage Site, to the Bandhavgarh National Park for the \u2018Royal Tiger Show\u2019 to the Kaziranga National Park to savour the \u2018Single-Horned Rhinoceros\u2019 that are on the verge of extinction.\n\nThere is more to your expeditions even as you enter the lone home for \u2018Asiatic Lions\u2019 in Gir National Park or enjoy the big cats and birdlife of the Kabini and Periyar way down south, with the exploration of the dense forests and wild beasts of more than 100 jungles in India through the \u2018Adventure and Wildlife\u2019 tour packages. You may have to sleep in eco tents or luxurious wildlife resorts or budget hotels but these sanctuaries will give you a pass into the parallel universe of the wildlife thriving in the Indian Territory in their own majesty and splendor. All the major online tour operators offer tour packages to enjoy the beastly species existing in our country, giving you the option to make your choice of tour location and other requirements.\nAbout The Package:\nNamaste Indi Trip is one of the reasonably-rated tour operators quite popular among tourists in India for its service quality and meeting the needs of the customers. This online company has designed \u2018adventure and wildlife\u2019 tour packages according to customer requisitions, catering to the smallest detail that these packages require. You will be taken to all the major wildlife sanctuaries of the country right from the eastern region to the western and southern regions of the country. Get a view of the exquisite flora and fauna variety in these important conservation areas and feel the presence of the innumerable species that survive in the different geographical locations of the Indian Territory. My Quick Trippers offers the customization facility for customers with tight financial budgets and their total enjoyment is thoroughly ensured by the professional expertise offered by the company.",
