  "magical-golden-triangle": {
    "overview": "The Golden Triangle trip takes you on an exciting journey to the three famous cities in India such as Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur. See More\n\nYour journey starts in Delhi, the capital city, where you will visit popular places like the Red Fort, India Gate, Qutub Minar and more, which are full of old history and modern life.Agra is known for the iconic Taj Mahal, a symbol of love, with the impressive Agra Fort and Fatehpur Sikri. Jaipur often called the Pink city of India, famous for Amber Fort and Hawa Mahal, which have beautiful architecture, and a great place for shopping traditional crafts in its vibrant markets. Our Golden Triangle Tour Packages cover everything, including the best accommodations, meals, comfortable transports, and amazing sightseeing. In addition, visitors can customize the trip for a more personal experience. Our customer support is also available 24/7. These places are filled with local culture, delicious food, and special history. Book this trip now and enjoy this amazing journey to make an unforgettable tour.See Less\n\nYour journey starts in Delhi, the capital city, where you will visit popular places like the Red Fort, India Gate, Qutub Minar and more, which are full of old history and modern life.\n\nAgra is known for the iconic Taj Mahal, a symbol of love, with the impressive Agra Fort and Fatehpur Sikri. Jaipur often called the Pink city of India, famous for Amber Fort and Hawa Mahal, which have beautiful architecture, and a great place for shopping traditional crafts in its vibrant markets.",
    "highlights": [
      "Explore India\u2019s most famous travel circuit covering Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur.",
      "Visit top UNESCO World Heritage Sites, including the magnificent Taj Mahal.",
      "Experience Delhi\u2019s rich history and vibrant markets in both Old and New Delhi.",
      "Make a spiritual stop at Mathura & Vrindavan, the birthplace of Lord Krishna.",
      "Enjoy colourful bazaars, local food, and traditional crafts throughout the journey.",
      "Learn from expert English-speaking guides at major monuments.",
      "Relax with smooth pick-up and drop-off services for a hassle-free trip.",
      "Travel comfortably in a private AC vehicle, at your own pace.",
      "Follow a thoughtfully planned itinerary for a memorable travel experience.",
      "See More"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
