  "manali-volvo-package": {
    "overview": "The breathtaking landscape is infused with the beauty of bountiful Nature. Not everyone knows that this beautiful hill station is actually named after the Puranic Hindu sage named Manu. He was the Hindu version of Noah, who saved millions of species of organisms and led them to reside here. Manali offers numerous options for adventure sports like rafting, paragliding, skiing and more. Avail our Manali Volvo package tour to get a lifetime experience.\n\nManali Volvo Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Delhi \u2013 Manali\n\n\nCatch Volvo Bus at 5:30 pm from Delhi for overnight journey to Manali covering 570 km in total.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Stay at Manali\n\n\nAfter your arrival at Manali in the morning, our My Quick Trippers representative will pick you up to transfer you to a hotel. In the hotel you take rest to relieve yourself of tiredness of the long journey. In the evening take an evening stroll on the Mall road and enjoy the evening beauty of the beautiful hill station.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Manali Rohtang Pass Sightseeing\n\n\nAfter the morning meal, we proceed for an entire day sightseeing of the beautiful locations of Kothi Gorge, Gulaba, Marhi, Rohtang Pass (Snow Point). Spend the night at the hotel to gear up for a fabulous sightseeing the next day.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Manali (Kullu \u2013 Manikaran)\n\n\nOn the fourth day of our beautiful journey, we spent the day visiting Kullu Valley, Kasol Valley, Rabbit Farm, Shawls Factory and Manikaran. You stay overnight at the hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 5 :Manali Local City Tour and Transfer to Delhi\n\n\nToday we will conduct local tour of Manali that constitutes Hidimba Devi Temple, Vashisht Village, Club House, Manu Temple, monasteries etc. We drop you to the nearest Volvo bus-stand for a return overnight journey towards Delhi.\n\n\n\n\nDay 6 :Arrival at Delhi\n\n\nYou arrive at Delhi in the morning with lots of memories of sweetest moments spent at the picturesque hill station. We thank you for your patronage and wish to receive your valued feedback. We are looking forward for another journey together very soon.",
    "highlights": [
      "Roam around the city and enjoy the evening on the mall road",
      "Enjoy the captivating snowcapped Rohtang pass",
      "Kullu and Kasol Valley",
      "Visit Manikaran",
      "Manali local tour"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
