  "mathura-vrindavan-tour": {
    "overview": "Lord Krishna, the most revered god, resides in Mathura and Vrindavan, the two heavenly locations on earth. These places are unlike any other places on earth in terms of spirit and environment. Every year, millions of people travel here specifically for this reason.\n\nAre you thinking of going there? but lack knowledge of it? Have courage. Everything you need to know about Mathura Vrindavan is in this post. Everything you need to know about travelling to Mathura and Vrindavan is available right here. The best time to visit, interesting places to see, and transportation alternatives are all covered in this 2 days / 1 night tour.\n\nAre you thinking of going there? but lack knowledge of it? Have courage. Everything you need to know about Mathura Vrindavan is in this post. Everything you need to know about travelling to Mathura and Vrindavan is available right here. The best time to visit, interesting places to see, and transportation alternatives are all covered in this 2 days / 1 night tour.\n\nMathura and Vrindavan Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Delhi \u2013 Mathura\n\n\nArrival at Delhi airport/ Railway Station, My Quick Trippers Representative will meet and greet you later we will drive to Mathura. In the afternoon after fresh-up visit Krishna Janam Bhoomi, and Dwarkadhish temple later visits Bankey Bihari temple, and Iskcon temple, take a participate in Evening Aarti at Vrindavan. Dinner & night stay in hotel Mathura.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Mathura City Darshan \u2013 Delhi\n\n\nToday after Breakfast, visit Rangaji Temple, Nidhi Van, Ghats, Barsana, and the museum at Mathura. Later drive back to Delhi. Here tour ends as we will drop you at Delhi Airport/ Railway station for your onward journey.",
    "highlights": [
      "Visit to the divine land of Krishna Janma Bhoomi Dwarkadhish",
      "Bankey Bihari Temple Darshan",
      "Mathura City tour and Darshan",
      "Visit to all the temples and relishing the prasad and blessings of the divinity"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Delhi \u2013 Mathura",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2 :Mathura City Darshan \u2013 Delhi",
        "description": ""
      }
    ],
