  "muktinath-kathmandu-tour": {
    "overview": "From the gently rolling plains to the highest peak of Mount Everest, Nepal is a fascinating composition of natural scenic wonders, religious sentiment and a mix of cultures all of which combine to give one of the most exotic experiences ever. Set out on this fantastic journey of discovery of Nepal with My Quick Trippers Muktinath Kathmandu Tour Package lasting all of 7 days 6 nights.\n\nTrip Highlights\n\nKathmandu Sightseeing\nSee the early morning Aarti at the Pashupatinath temple\nVisit the Budhanilkantha temple, where Vishnu is portrayed reclining\nAlso visit the Barahi temple and the Seti Gandaki River\nMuktinath temple Darshan\nPokhara sightseeing\nFinally visit the Manakamana temple\n\nTrip Highlights\n\nKathmandu Sightseeing\nSee the early morning Aarti at the Pashupatinath temple\nVisit the Budhanilkantha temple, where Vishnu is portrayed reclining\nAlso visit the Barahi temple and the Seti Gandaki River\nMuktinath temple Darshan\nPokhara sightseeing\nFinally visit the Manakamana temple",
    "highlights": [
      "Kathmandu Sightseeing",
      "See the early morning Aarti at the Pashupatinath temple",
      "Visit the Budhanilkantha temple, where Vishnu is portrayed reclining",
