  "north-east-india-wildlife-tour": {
    "overview": "A safari to Nameri and Kaziranga National Parks is billed as a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. This 8-day / 7-night tour package allows wildlife enthusiasts to explore the exotic flora and fauna of Kaziranga and Nameri. In their natural habitats, elephants, tigers, deer, clouded leopards, sloth bears, and, of course, one-horned rhinoceros will be on display.\n\nYou might be able to observe and photograph the amazing birdlife. In addition, we provide excellent accommodation options based on your needs. Prepare to be captivated if you go on this wildlife tour.\nExplore the region\u2019s rich biodiversity and spend time with some rare animals and plants during your North East India wildlife holidays. You can even personalize your vacation based on your interests. Spend the day on an exciting safari ride and the night in a wilderness camp or resort. India has a diverse flora and fauna.\n\nYou might be able to observe and photograph the amazing birdlife. In addition, we provide excellent accommodation options based on your needs. Prepare to be captivated if you go on this wildlife tour.\n\nExplore the region\u2019s rich biodiversity and spend time with some rare animals and plants during your North East India wildlife holidays. You can even personalize your vacation based on your interests. Spend the day on an exciting safari ride and the night in a wilderness camp or resort. India has a diverse flora and fauna.\n\nNorth East India Wildlife Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Arrival at Guwahati and Moving on to Kaziranga National Park\n\n\nThe My Quick Trippers representative will pick you up from the Guwahati airport and safely escort you through a 5 and half-hour drive to the Kaziranga National Park which is situated 225km away from Guwahati. Check in at the hotel booked for you and rest for the night.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :At Kaziranga National Park\n\n\nGet up early morning on day 2 and start the day with an Elephant Safari. Return to the hotel for breakfast and gear up for a Jeep Safari after that. This safari will take place in the Park\u2019s Western range. Late in the afternoon enjoying the rhino scenery along with bird-watching and other activities in the Park. Get back to the hotel for dinner and overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Kaziranga National Park to Nameri National Park\n\n\nDay 3 starts with early breakfast after which you will be driven to the Nameri National Park, checking out of the Kaziranga National Park. On way you can stop for visiting Tezpur. Check into the hotel at Nameri and rest for the night. You can also opt for camping at Nameri and spend the night in the camp.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :At Nameri National Park\n\n\nPost breakfast get ready for Nameri National Park exploration. Here you can discover the flora variety and the different species of animals dwelling in this region. Lay down is any of the shady areas of the Park and get back to the camp/hotel in the evening for campfire and dinner. Take rest for the night here.\n\n\n\n\nDay 5 :Nameri National Park to Shillong\n\n\nPost breakfast on day 5 you will be driven to Shillong and transferred to the hotel here. Check in and freshen up. Spend the evening strolling or shopping in the local market. Get back to the hotel for dinner and rest.\n\n\n\n\nDay 6 :Shillong to Cherrapunjee and Back to Shillong\n\n\nEarly morning after breakfast you will leave for Cherrapunjee. Stop at the Elephant Falls and Shillong Park on way. As soon as you reach Cherrapunjee you will visit the Nohkalikai Falls, Ramakrishna Mission and the Mawsmai Cave. Get back to Shillong for dinner and overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 7 :Shillong to Guwahati\n\n\nAfter breakfast on day 7, check out of Shillong hotel to move on to Guwahati. Visit the Lady Hydari Park, Cathedral Church and Ward\u2019s Lake on way. On reaching Guwahati you will be transferred to the hotel here for check-in after which you can freshen up and rest for some time. Take a cruise on the \u2018Brahmaputra\u2019 river in the evening time. Spend the night in the Guwahati hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 8 :Guwahati Departure\n\n\nOn the final day have a hearty breakfast after which you will be escorted to the Guwahati airport to get back home safely. The greens, the splendid natural bounties and wildlife of North East would definitely leave an indelible impression on your mind.",
    "highlights": [
      "Be a part of the wilderness at the Kaziranga National Park",
      "An Early morning wildlife safari",
      "Visit to the Nameri National Park",
      "Wildlife safari at Nameri",
      "City tour at Shillong and Cherrapunji, the monsoon capital"
    ],
