  "omkareshwar-mahakaleshwar-helicopter-tour": {
    "overview": "Experience spiritual fulfilment as you embark on a sacred aerial journey to Omkareshwar and Ujjain's sacred sites. See More\n\nThe helicopter Yatra offers a rare opportunity to connect with the divine and admire the breathtaking beauty of the picturesque landscapes. Our packages are well-crafted and include everything essential.\nWe provide customized Omkareshwar Ujjain Helicopter Tour packages for families, groups, and solo travelers at the best rates. These packages offer a range of amenities, including comfortable accommodations, tasty food, and priority access to renowned shrines for Darshan. We assist you throughout the journey, ensuring you can get the best value out of your trip.\nSee Less\n\nThe helicopter Yatra offers a rare opportunity to connect with the divine and admire the breathtaking beauty of the picturesque landscapes. Our packages are well-crafted and include everything essential.\n\nWe provide customized Omkareshwar Ujjain Helicopter Tour packages for families, groups, and solo travelers at the best rates. These packages offer a range of amenities, including comfortable accommodations, tasty food, and priority access to renowned shrines for Darshan. We assist you throughout the journey, ensuring you can get the best value out of your trip.\n\nTour Highlights\n\n\nSightseeing tour of Indore.\nAerial journey to Omkareshwar and Ujjain.\nDivine Darshan of Sri Omkareshwar Mahadev at Omkareshwar Temple.\nAttend Bhasma Aarti at Mahakaleshwar Temple.\nSee More",
    "highlights": [
      "Sightseeing tour of Indore.",
      "Aerial journey to Omkareshwar and Ujjain.",
      "Divine Darshan of Sri Omkareshwar Mahadev at Omkareshwar Temple.",
      "Attend Bhasma Aarti at Mahakaleshwar Temple.",
      "See More"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1: Arrival at Indore",
        "description": "As you arrive at Indore Railway Station or Airport, you will meet our courteous representative, who will welcome you gladly.\nYou can spend the evening as you want. You can explore the local markets, embark on a sightseeing tour, or spend some leisure time in your hotel unwinding from the stress of the day.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2: Indore \u2013 Omkareshwar \u2013 Ujjain",
        "description": "Post a tasty breakfast, you'll be picked up from your hotel.\nYou'll be taken to the airport, where you will meet our ground representative, who will inform you about all the helicopter boarding formalities.\nYou're advised to arrive at least two hours before the flight to the helipad so that you can complete all the boarding formalities on time.\nAfter around 25 minutes of aerial journey, you will reach Omkareshwar Helipad.\nAbout Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga\nOmkareshwar Temple\nis considered to be one of the holiest shrines in India and one of the\ntwelve revered Jyotirlingas\n. The sacred temple is located on Mandhata Island, which is situated at the meeting point of the Kaveri and Narmada Rivers. The island is in the shape of the Hindu 'OM' symbol. On this island, there are many temples, and the actual Jyotirlinga is believed to be in the Mamleshwar temple. To facilitate travelers to have a fast and secure Darshan of Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga, PM Shri Heli Tourism Service was started by the MP Tourism Board, as reported by\nNDTV\n.\nOnce you have arrived at Omkareshwar, you will be transferred to Omkareshwar Temple.\nAt Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga, you'll have VIP Darshan of Sri Omkareshwar Mahadev.\nAfter the divine Darshan, you will be taken back to the helipad.\nAfter flying for around 40 minutes, you will reach the Ujjain helipad.\nOnce you have arrived at Ujjain, you will be transferred to your pre-booked hotel.\nThen you will visit the famous attractions, including Harsiddhi Temple, Ram Ghat, and the local markets.\nIn the evening, you will return to your hotel and savor a tasty dinner.\nHave an overnight stay at your hotel.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3: Bhasma Aarti and Return to Indore",
        "description": "Wake up early in the morning, and then you will head to the Mahakaleshwar Temple as per our Omkareshwar Ujjain air travel package.\nNext, you'll attend the Bhasma Aarti, which happens daily at approximately 4:00 AM.\nAbout Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga\nMahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga is one of the holiest places dedicated to Shiva in India. The temple is a Jyotirlinga and one of the holy abodes of Lord Shiva. It is located at Ujjain in the state of Madhya Pradesh. This sacred temple is located on the side of the river Shipra. The presiding deity of this temple is Shiva in the lingam form, and it is believed to be Swayambhu.\nAfter the Darshan, you will head back to your hotel and have a luscious breakfast.\nYou will be transferred to Ujjain Helipad from where you will take your flight to Indore Helipad.\nWith this Omkareshwar Ujjain Helicopter Tour package will come to an end.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
  },
