  "rajasthan-wildlife-tour": {
    "overview": "You can see the rarest bird species, Thar animals, and the majestic Royal Bengal Tigers by booking a Rajasthan wildlife tour.\n\nJoin us for Tiger Safari adventures in Ranthambore and Sariska National Parks. With our 7-day/6-night tour package, you can choose wildlife and national park tours across Rajasthan, which not only covers popular destinations but also opens doors to offbeat places for ardent wildlife lovers.\n\nJoin us for Tiger Safari adventures in Ranthambore and Sariska National Parks. With our 7-day/6-night tour package, you can choose wildlife and national park tours across Rajasthan, which not only covers popular destinations but also opens doors to offbeat places for ardent wildlife lovers.\n\nRajasthan Wildlife Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Jaipur Arrival\n\n\nThe My Quick Trippers representative will welcome you in Jaipur and drive you to the hotel that has been booked for you. After checking in you can relax and in the evening you can gorge upon the authentic food of Rajasthan or shop for handicrafts and other souvenirs. Spend the night in the hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Jaipur Sightseeing\n\n\nPost breakfast on day 2 start for a sightseeing tour with the Amber Fort, City Palace, Jal Mahal, Hawa Mahal and Observatory. Dedicate the evening to shopping and get back to the hotel for overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Jaipur to Sariska (Jungle Safari of 125 Kms. /2.5 hours)\n\n\nOn day 3 after an early and hearty breakfast, you will drive to Sariska. Once you arrive here you will check into the hotel. In the afternoon start for a Jungle Safari and enjoy the different species living in this hot, dry land and return to the hotel for dinner and night stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Sariska to Bharatpur (160 Kms/3 hours)\n\n\nDay 4 will begin with breakfast after which you will leave for Bharatpur, one of the world\u2019s largest bird sanctuaries. Check into a hotel here and enjoy the aviary population of the reserve before it gets dark. Get back to the hotel for overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 5 :Bharatpur to Ranthambore (250 Kms/5 hours)\n\n\nOn day 5 begin the day with a filling breakfast after which you will be taken to the Tiger Reserve in Ranthambore. After arrival in Ranthambore check into the hotel and spend the night in the hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 6 :Jungle Safari at Ranthambore\n\n\nDay 6 will start with breakfast and followed by Jungle Safari of 3-4 hours each in the morning and the afternoon. You can search for as many tigers as you want during this tour. Do not forget to enjoy other flora and fauna existing in this region. For dinner and night stay return to the hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 7 :Ranthambore to Jaipur (190 Kms/4 hours)\n\n\nOn the final day have a sumptuous breakfast after which you will be taken back to Jaipur to return home safely by the My Quick Trippers representative.",
    "highlights": [
      "City tour of the Pink City",
      "Afternoon jungle safari at Sariska",
      "Relive freshness at the Bharatpur, world\u2019s biggest Bird sanctuary",
      "Be a part of the Ranthambore Tiger reserve and watch the big cats",
      "Also the delicious Rajasthani delicacies"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Jaipur Arrival",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2 :Jaipur Sightseeing",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3 :Jaipur to Sariska (Jungle Safari of 125 Kms. /2.5 hours)",
        "description": ""
      },
