  "romantic-andman": {
    "overview": "Andaman and Nicobar Island are pristine jewels of nature nestling in playful blue waters of the Bay of Bengal. The weather is perfect; the scenery is enchanting and just perfect for honeymooners. Newlyweds will love NamasteIndiaTrip Romantic Andaman Tour that stretches over 5 nights and 6 days in this fairytale setting.\n\nAndaman Honeymoon Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Arrive in Port Blair\n\n\nArrive in Port Blair to a warm welcome by our tour guide who escorts you to your hotel. Rest and refresh yourself with a hearty lunch and then set out with the others to explore Corbyn\u2019s Cove Beach, about 9 km from Port Blair. The lovely silvery beach with the surf gently lapping the shoreline is made for some fun and frolic so enjoy. Later, after you have had your fill, we set out to visit the Cellular Jail and take in the Light and Sound show depicting the freedom struggle. Return to your hotel room for the night.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Port Blair \u2013 Havelock Island (57 km)\n\n\nBreakfast and checkout of the hotel. The group boards a ferry at Port Blair Jetty for the 2.5 hours trip to Havelock Island, a beautiful sun-kissed island made for lovers. Check into your room and then set out to have fun at the Radha Nagar Beach, the best in Asia. Time flies quickly and all too soon you have to return to the hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Excursion to Elephant Beach\n\n\nIt is a fine morning and, after breakfast, the group sets out for Elephant Beach to have some more fun and frolic. This beach with its coral reefs is perfect for snorkeling and you will love the colorful underwater life.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Havelock Island \u2013 Port Blair (57 Km)\n\n\nBreakfast over you and others of the group once again check out of the hotel and are free to explore the surroundings on your own. In the evening the group gathers to board the ferry for the return journey to Port Blair where you check into your room in a nice hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 5 :Port Blair Sightseeing\n\n\nToday, after breakfast, we set out on a local sightseeing tour that takes us to the Fisheries Museum, to Chatham Saw Mill, the Water Sports complex and the Anthropological Museum. It is lunchtime and you have the rest of the day free for shopping and relaxing.\n\n\n\n\nDay 6 :Tour Ends\n\n\nBreakfast and pack your bags and check out. Our tour guide assists you with onward departure as the tour ends and you promise to return on your anniversary for another wonderful Andaman tour with myquicktrippers.com.",
    "highlights": [
      "Explore with your soulmate the Corbyn\u2019s Cove Beach",
      "Take in the Light and Sound show depicting the freedom struggle at the Cellular Jail.",
      "Enjoy the beautiful sun-kissed Havelock Island",
      "Port Blair sightseeing tour includes visits to the Fisheries Museum, Chatham Saw Mill, Water Sports Complex, and the Anthropological Museum."
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Arrive in Port Blair",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2 :Port Blair \u2013 Havelock Island (57 km)",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3 :Excursion to Elephant Beach",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4 :Havelock Island \u2013 Port Blair (57 Km)",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
