  "sangam-darshan": {
    "overview": "The Triveni Sangam Darshan in Prayagraj is a confluence of 3 rivers which are Ganga, Yamuna and Saraswati and is one of the prime pilgrimage centres for Hindus. A 4 days and 3 nights of Sangam darshan in Prayagraj Package will ensure that your journey is spiritually evoking. It is also believed that a dip here will wash away all your sins.\n\nPrayagraj Sangam Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Arrival in Varanasi \u2013 Bodhgaya\n\n\nUpon your arrival in Varanasi, our tour representative will make you proceed to the ancient holy town of Bodhgaya which is situated at a distance of 6 hours. Once you arrive at Bodhgaya you will be immediately checked in to your allotted for an overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Bodhgaya \u2013 Varanasi\n\n\nEarly in the morning you will be taken on a full day sightseeing tour of Bodhgaya where you will be made to seen the following places \u2013 Vishnu pad mandir \u2013 which is said to house the footprints of Lord Vishnu; Mahabodhi mandir \u2013 which is home to a bodhi tree under which Lord Buddha had attained his enlightenment. Apart from the said temples, you will also be taken to some of the international temples like \u2013 Japanese Temple, Vietnamese temple, Thai temple and monastery.\nAfter a full day of temple touring you will be driven back to Varanasi for an overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Varanasi \u2013 Prayagraj\n\n\nYour early morning will begin in a glorious manner with a majestic boat ride on the River Ganga from where you will be made to witness the beautiful sunrise. Later on your temple tour will commence which will be covering places like \u2013 Kashi Vishwanath Mandir, Durga Mandir, Sarnath museum and Banaras Hindu University.\nLater on you will be made to proceed towards the holy and sacred city of Prayagraj which is situated at a distance of 2 hours and 30 mines. Upon your arrival in Prayagraj, you will be made to immediately check in to your hotel for an overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Prayagraj \u2013 Departure\n\n\nYou will be made to proceed towards the famous Triveni Sangam for a sacred dip in the holy waters. You will also be made to visit Ananda Bhawan and Hanuman Mandir. Finally, you will be transferred to your railway station or airport from where your onwards journey to your desired destination will commence hence ending your trip with us.",
    "highlights": [
      "Varanasi tour",
      "Visit to The Bodhgaya Shrine",
      "Enjoying the food and trip at Varanasi",
      "Prayagraj Sangam Darshan and rituals",
      "Sightseeing in Allahabad",
      "Do enjoy the local food"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Arrival in Varanasi \u2013 Bodhgaya",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2 :Bodhgaya \u2013 Varanasi",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
