  "scuba-diving-andaman": {
    "overview": "If you love scuba diving, it is not Singapore or Goa that you should head for but Andaman, gloriously unspoiled and beautiful in the extreme when it comes to underwater marine life. Enjoy some of the finest moments in your life with NamasteIndiaTrip 3 nights 4 days Scuba diving tour of Andaman.\n\nAndaman Scuba Diving Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Port Blair \u2013 Havelock Island\n\n\nFly in and be greeted warmly by our representative at Port Blair who then escorts you to the ferry for the trip to Havelock Island where you check into your hotel and set out on an exploratory trip on your own.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Long Island Scuba Diving\n\n\nBoard a boat after breakfast for the trip to Long Island. It is a leisurely trip with opportunities to go diving en route.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Scuba Diving\n\n\nAfter breakfast, everyone sets out for the reef where instructors hand out scuba diving gear. Jump into the waters and explore the splendidly hued underwater life in this amazing coral reef site. Return for lunch, rest and take a walk before getting ready to dive by moonlight.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Return to Port Blair\n\n\nBreakfast, check out of the hotel and return to Port Blair where the tour ends and you are bid a fond farewell by our tour guide.\n\nAndaman Scuba Diving Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Port Blair \u2013 Havelock Island\n\n\nFly in and be greeted warmly by our representative at Port Blair who then escorts you to the ferry for the trip to Havelock Island where you check into your hotel and set out on an exploratory trip on your own.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Long Island Scuba Diving\n\n\nBoard a boat after breakfast for the trip to Long Island. It is a leisurely trip with opportunities to go diving en route.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Scuba Diving\n\n\nAfter breakfast, everyone sets out for the reef where instructors hand out scuba diving gear. Jump into the waters and explore the splendidly hued underwater life in this amazing coral reef site. Return for lunch, rest and take a walk before getting ready to dive by moonlight.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Return to Port Blair\n\n\nBreakfast, check out of the hotel and return to Port Blair where the tour ends and you are bid a fond farewell by our tour guide.",
    "highlights": [
      "Explore the Havelock Island in Andaman",
      "Visit Long island the hub for scuba diving",
      "Explore the underwater coral reefs, in the daylight and even at night under the moon",
      "Port Blair return"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Port Blair \u2013 Havelock Island",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
