  "shimla-tour": {
    "overview": "Grab our beautifully designed 2 Nights / 3 Days long sightseeing tour in Shimla and visit the iconic attractions of this gorgeous hill station. Enjoy the magnificent snowfall at Kufri and admire the breathtaking beauty of the region adorned with astounding valleys and the lush green valleys.\n\nShimla Sightseeing Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Arrival in Shimla\n\n\nOn reaching Shimla you will be escorted to the pre-booked by an air-conditioned transport. Post-check-into the hotel, loosen up yourself and get freshen up to enjoy the nightlife of this beautiful hill station. After relaxing for a few hours in the comfortable hotel room set out of the hotel to enjoy the amazing beauty of this place. After an admiring evening stroll return to the hotel for enjoying the night meal which is then followed by an energized overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Sightseeing in Shimla\n\n\nAfter savoring a delectable breakfast, get ready for the complete day sightseeing tour of Shimla. The day starts with Kufri excursion which is one of the most beautiful places where one can enjoy playing with the snowballs as the entire region gets covered with thick sheets of snow. Next, you will be visiting the famous Christ Church, Ridge Maidan, and Mall Road. After completing a fun-filled day, drive back to the hotel for dinner and a relaxing overnight stay.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Departure from Shimla\n\n\nOn the final day of your journey, you will be served with the lip-smacking morning meal. Post breakfast, check-out from the hotel and then you will be transferred to the airport for your onward journey towards home. The journey concludes.",
    "highlights": [
      "Visiting the Shimla Museum, Mall Road, Christ Church, Viceroy Lodge, Ridge Maidan.",
      "Explore the local markets and buy some amazing handlooms and handicrafts.",
      "Visit Kufri and other beautiful suburb places to witness amazing snowfall."
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Arrival in Shimla",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2 :Sightseeing in Shimla",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3 :Departure from Shimla",
        "description": ""
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
