  "shimla-volvo-package": {
    "overview": "The Queen of Hills Shimla is the most adorable and frequently visited by travelers within the country all round year. Even many globe trotters visit the hill city frequently. Being near the capital city of Delhi, many prefer short trips for their weekend vacation plans. Also, it is a very popular vacation destination during the summer, and it is well-known for its Victorian architecture, which can be seen in certain areas of the Mall and The Ridge. It\u2019s also a popular honeymoon spot. This 4 days / 3 nights tour package is best for a family weekend retreat.\n\nShimla Volvo Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Delhi \u2013 Shimla\n\n\nCatch the Volvo bus from Delhi to Shimla in the evening at 8:30 P.M. Overnight in the Bus.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :In Shimla\n\n\nAfter breakfast go for the sightseeing Shimla covering Kalbadevi Temple, Hanuman Temple or stop for a while at the beautiful stained-glass-windows of Christ Church, Which was built in the 1850 \u2018s. Afternoon excursion to Kufri a 30 Minutes\u2019 drive from Shimla, an exotica of nature as a place surrounded by dense forest and snow-capped Mountains amidst virgin peaks and natures flora and Fauna where one can completely relax and tune oneself for natural beauty, Evening free to enjoy the scenic Beauty of Kufri. Fagu, Indira Gandhi Holiday Home and Enjoy horse riding in the apple orchids. Return to the Hotel Rest of the day is free to explore various scenic sights or visit mall road and Shopping. Night stay at Hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Shimla \u2013 Naldehra & Mashobra Sightseeing\n\n\nToday you will go for Mashobra and Naldehra sightseeing full day. Evening back to the Hotel. Overnight stay at Shimla.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Shimla \u2013 Delhi\n\n\nMorning, after breakfast we will drop you at Volvo stand. You will reach Delhi by 6-7 PM.\nThank you for your patronage and looks forward to serving you again in the near future.",
    "highlights": [
      "Best Volvo bus service allotted",
      "Well-planned day for the tour of the town with shopping and sightseeing",
      "A visit to the Mashobra and Naldehra",
      "Enjoying the best local cuisine"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Delhi \u2013 Shimla",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2 :In Shimla",
        "description": ""
      },
