        "title": "Day 3 :Shimla \u2013 Naldehra & Mashobra Sightseeing",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4 :Shimla \u2013 Delhi",
        "description": ""
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
