  "trip-to-heart-of-india": {
    "overview": "The land of Madhya Pradesh is termed as the \u2018heart of India\u2019 not only because it is centrally located but also because it is home to all the various cultural heritages that Islam, Jainism, Buddhism and Hinduism have to offer.\n\nYou will come across several significant monuments; Stupas and temples that are intricately carved; and palaces and forts within the boundaries of the region. There is an equal amount of variation in the flora and fauna of the land. Despite being predominantly a plateau based area, it is filled with forests like the \u2018Satpura\u2019, the \u2018Vindhya-Kaimur\u2019, the \u2018Baghelkhand\u2019 plateau and the \u2018Maikala\u2019 ranges. This state offers a picturesque setting with meandering rivers, fascinating mountain ranges and large, dense forests that include a panoramic view of the wildlife here. Madhya Pradesh boats of being named the \u2018Tiger State of India\u2019 owing to favourable geographic and climatic conditions for the \u2018Leo Tigers\u2019, an endangered species. You can spot these amazing royal animals in the Vindhya-Kaimur hill ranges and the Mahanadi and Narmada river banks. This region also houses the largest tribal population concentration in India which is estimated to go well over 22 million. Thus, the land of Madhya Pradesh is compelling in every way for a visit.\nAbout The Package:\nMy Quick Trippers organizes a special holiday package for travellers interested in visiting the forested land of Madhya Pradesh. This exclusive package gives you the opportunity to explore the various exquisite and historically significant monuments of this region including the Sanchi Stupa erected by Emperor Ashoka. You can also enjoy the beauty of nature as you move deeper into the forests and come face-to-face with the wildlife here. The natives of Madhya Pradesh along with the pre-historic caves of this area will also be covered in this trip. The professional touch of My Quick Trippers makes each and every tour package ideal for a traveller. All the important aspects of a trip are prioritized to the smallest detail for the comfort and safety of the customers. This well-established online travel agency also makes provisions for customizing the tour packages to fit your financial expenses so that you get to enjoy the trip without any problems.",
    "highlights": [
      "Visit to the Sanchi Stupa",
      "A visit to Udayagiri, where you can see the famous 'rock cut' caves built during the reign of the Guptas during the 'Golden Age'",
      "Bhopal city tour",
      "Visit to Bhojpur to pay homage at the Shiv Mandir\u2019 which is said to possess the biggest \u2018Shivling\u2019 in the entire globe",
      "Visit to Pachmarhi",
      "Dhoopgarh sightseeing"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Bhopal Arrival and Sightseeing at Udaygiri and Sanchi:",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2 :Bhojpur, Bhimbetka Visit and Leave for Pachmarhi:",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3 :Pachmarhi Visit:",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4 :Dhoopgarh Sightseeing:",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 5 :End of Tour:",
        "description": ""
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
  },
