  "ujjain-omkareshwar-mandu-tour-from-indore": {
    "overview": "Want to go on a trip that is filled with cultural exploration, beautiful architecture, and spirituality through and through? Then book our Indore Ujjain Omkareshwar Maheshwar Mandu Tour Package and travel to these beautiful places in utter luxury and comfort.See More\n\nYou\u2019ll be visiting the two Jyotirlingas on this trip \u2013 Mahakaleshwar and Omkareshwar. Feel the divinity of the place with unique ceremonies like Bhasma Aarti and holy river rituals! So what are you waiting for? Book now and go on blissful trip like never before!Besides spirituality, you also have a lot of fun activities planned in this tour itinerary. You\u2019ll be enjoying the boat rides, visiting palaces that resemble a ship, and even going for swims in the river! From spending evenings at the serene Ghats to exploring the grandeur of the palaces, you have a lot to see and enjoy on this trip. Also, if you\u2019re wondering about your travel logistics, then worry not. We\u2019ve got you covered! From your hotel charges to dining bills to travel expenses, all will be borne by us. Call us now to know more or get a quote!See Less\n\nYou\u2019ll be visiting the two Jyotirlingas on this trip \u2013 Mahakaleshwar and Omkareshwar. Feel the divinity of the place with unique ceremonies like Bhasma Aarti and holy river rituals! So what are you waiting for? Book now and go on blissful trip like never before!\n\nBesides spirituality, you also have a lot of fun activities planned in this tour itinerary. You\u2019ll be enjoying the boat rides, visiting palaces that resemble a ship, and even going for swims in the river! From spending evenings at the serene Ghats to exploring the grandeur of the palaces, you have a lot to see and enjoy on this trip. Also, if you\u2019re wondering about your travel logistics, then worry not. We\u2019ve got you covered! From your hotel charges to dining bills to travel expenses, all will be borne by us. Call us now to know more or get a quote!",
    "highlights": [
      "Seek blessings at Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga and Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga",
      "Witness the Bhasma Aarti at Mahakaleshwar Temple (Optional)",
      "Explore Ahilyabai Holkar Fort",
      "Spiritual tour to various temples of Maheshwar",
      "Evening visit to Ram Ghat",
      "Visit to the \u201cCity of Joy\u201d, Mandu",
      "Enjoy boat rides on the Narmada River",
      "See More"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1: Arrival in Indore \u2013 Sightseeing in Ujjain (60 km - 2-2.5 hrs)",
        "description": "Once you arrive at Indore airport or railway station, our tour representative will greet you with a warm welcome. Now, you\u2019ll be taken on a sightseeing tour in\nUjjain\n\u2013 the city famous for hosting the\nKumbha Mela\n.\nOur very first stop will be the\nMahakaleshwar Temple\n, which is one of the 12 Jyotirlingas of Lord Shiva. Seek Darshan and the blessings of the lord here. Also, take pictures of the\nShri Mahakal Lok corridor\nand the magnificent temple architecture.\nLater, we\u2019ll go on a temple tour:\nISKON temple\nHarsiddhi Mata Temple(Shaktipeeth)\nSandipani Ashram\nBade Ganesh Ka Mandir\nMahakal Lok\nGadkalika Temple\nIn the evening, take a trip to the\nRam Ghat\n.\nAlso, we\u2019ll visit the\nMahakaleshwar Temple\nagain to attend the mesmerising\nevening Aarti\n.\nNow, you\u2019ll be taken to your pre-booked hotel. Check in and get a restful night of sleep.\nNote:\nYou can book for the\nBhasma Aarti\nonline at\nhttps://shrimahakaleshwar.com/bhasmarti\n.\nNote:\nYou can also book for\nVIP Darshan\nonline by visiting\nhttps://shrimahakaleshwar.com/sheeghra-darshan\n.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2: Ujjain to Omkareshwar (139 km / 3-4 hrs)",
        "description": "Have a delicious breakfast in the morning.\nNow, you\u2019ll be taken to the town of\nOmkareshwar\n, which is in the shape of the \u2018OM\u2019 symbol, and is also very dear to Lord Shiva.\nOnce you get there, take a holy dip in the\nNarmada River\nfirst. After that, proceed to Darshan and Poojan in this yet another Jyotirlinga of this tour \u2013\nOmkareshwar Temple\n.\nNow, we\u2019ll take you to the\nMamleshwar temple\n, which is famous for having inscriptions from the 11th century! Maharani Ahilyabai Holkar funded this temple, and now it is a cherished and protected monument of ASI.\nAfter that, do the\nParikrama of Narmada\n. This 7 km path is laid out in a circular track up the stairs. On this Parikrama, you\u2019ll also witness several temples and ashrams!\nLater, you can go on an exciting\nboat ride\non the Narmada River, payment for which will be made on a direct basis.\nWe\u2019ll also take you to\nThe Statue of Oneness\n, which is dedicated to Adi Shankaracharya (if time permits).\nYour overnight stay will be arranged in\nOmkareshwar\n.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3: Omkareshwar \u2013 Maheshwar \u2013 Mandu (130-140 km/ 3.5-4 hrs)",
        "description": "Have a delicious breakfast in the morning.\nNow, you\u2019ll be driven to the city of\nMaheshwar\n, which was once the capital of Ahilyabai Holkar\u2019s kingdom!\nHere, you\u2019ll be visiting:\nAhilya Fort & Palace\n\u2013 The residence of the Holkar queen!\nAkhileshwar Temple\n\u2013 It\u2019s inside the fort complex itself.\nNarmada Ghats\n\u2013 Enjoy boat rides here. Also, take pictures of the gorgeous sunset here!\nNow, you\u2019ll be taken to the historic town of\nMandu\n, which is popularly called as the \u2018\nCity of Joy\n\u2019. You\u2019ll be visiting the following:\nRoopmati Pavilion\nEcho point\nDai Ka Mahal\nBaz Bahadur's Palace\nJami Masjid\nAfter the sightseeing tour concludes for the day, you\u2019ll be taken to your hotel for an overnight stay.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4: Mandu Sightseeing + Transfer to Indore (95-100 km/ 3-4 hrs)",
        "description": "Treat yourself to a delicious breakfast in the morning.\nNow, it's time for some sightseeing. The very first tourist attraction that you\u2019ll be visiting today is\nThe Royal Enclave Jahaz Mahal\n. This ship-like palace is famous for its beauty. Do capture pictures of the stunning Jahaz Mahal reflections in water!\nAfter that, we\u2019ll be visiting the following:\nHindola Mahal\nDarwazas of Mandu\nHoshang Shah's Tomb\nNow, you\u2019ll be driven to\nIndore\n, where you\u2019ll be visiting the\nRajwada\nand\nLalbagh Palace\n. Also, stroll through its bustling markets and indulge in the sweets and street food here, for which Indore is famous.\nNow, you\u2019ll be transferred to the Indore airport or railway station, as per your choice. This concludes your trip with us. Hope you had a nice journey!\nNote:\nIf you're travelling during the\nSawan month\n, then your route might get diverted due to the\nKanwar Yatra\n.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
  },
  "ujjain-omkareshwar-tour": {
    "overview": "What\u2019s one place that spoils you with beautiful Ghats, ancient temples, and cultural monuments?See More\n\nIt\u2019s none other than the holy city of Ujjain!  Tourists never leave unimpressed from this one of the Sapta Puris! If you want to enjoy a smooth and comfortable tour here, then book our 4 day/3 night Ujjain Omkareshwar tour!\nWith our services, you don\u2019t have to worry about any of the travel logistics. From your accommodation to meals to transport, everything will be handled by us! In fact, you can even customize the package to your liking, adding more sightseeing destinations and even changing the trip duration. Simply give us a call, and we\u2019ll plan your next pilgrimage!\nSee Less\n\nIt\u2019s none other than the holy city of Ujjain!  Tourists never leave unimpressed from this one of the Sapta Puris! If you want to enjoy a smooth and comfortable tour here, then book our 4 day/3 night Ujjain Omkareshwar tour!\n\nWith our services, you don\u2019t have to worry about any of the travel logistics. From your accommodation to meals to transport, everything will be handled by us! In fact, you can even customize the package to your liking, adding more sightseeing destinations and even changing the trip duration. Simply give us a call, and we\u2019ll plan your next pilgrimage!\n\nTour Gallery\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTour Name\nIndore to Ujjain Omkareshwar Tour\n\n\nTour Duration\n04 Days / 03 Nights\n\n\nMeals\nBreakfast & Dinner\n\n\nVehicle Type\nSedan / SUV\n\n\nStarting & Ending Point\nIndore\n\n\nDestination Covered\nIndore - Ujjain - Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga \n\n\nPickup Time\nDepend on your Flight Timing \n\n\n Tour Benefits\nBest price & enjoyable travel guarantee",
    "highlights": [
      "Explore the rich culture and heritage of Indore",
      "Visits to Rajwada, Lal Bagh Palace, Central Museum, Gomatgiri, and Kanch Mandir",
      "Seek Darshan and blessings at the Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga",
      "Trip to prominent shrines like ISKCON Temple, Harsiddhi Temple, Sandipani Ashram, Chintaman Ganesh, and Bade Ganesh Ji Ka Mandir",
      "Watch the unique Bhasm Aarti at Mahakaleshwar Temple",
      "Discover the popular tourist attractions like Kajal Rani Cave and Statue of Oneness (dedicated to Adi Shankaracharya)",
      "Watch evening Aarti at the Ram Ghat",
      "Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga Temple tour",
      "Enjoy a scenic boat ride on the Narmada River",
      "Take part in the Narmada River Parikrama",
      "Visit famous temples like Satmatrika Temple, Siddhanth Mandir, and Shri Omkar Mandhata Temple"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1: Arrival in Indore",
        "description": "Once you arrive in Indore, you\u2019ll find our team representative at Indore Airport /Railway Station.\nFrom there, you'll be driven to your pre-booked hotel.\nEnjoy a restful night of sleep."
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2: Indore - Ujjain Sightseeing (60 km - 2 hrs)",
        "description": "Relish a hearty breakfast, and then get ready for an Ujjain sightseeing tour!\nFirst of all, you\u2019ll be taken to the Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga temple.\nThereafter, visit some prominent temples in the area, like ISKCON temple, Shakti Peeth, Harsiddhi Temple, Sandipani Ashram, and Bade Ganesh Ka Mandir.\nVisit the Mahakaleshwar temple again to attend the mesmerizing evening Aarti!\nEnjoy an overnight stay at the hotel.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3: Ujjain - Omkareshwar (140 km - 4 hrs)",
        "description": "Have breakfast.\nTake a trip to the Omkareshwar Temple, which is yet another Jyotirlinga! Take a few dips in the Narmada River first before proceeding to the shrine for Darshan and Poojan.\nAlso, do Narmada Parikrama. You can even enjoy a boat ride here!\nNow, visit the ancient Mamleshwar temple. A trip to \u2018The Statue of Oneness\u2019 will also be arranged if time permits.\nHave an overnight stay at Omkareshwar!\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 4: Omkareshwar - Indore (80 km - 3 hrs)",
        "description": "Enjoy breakfast! Today, you\u2019ll be taken for a cultural tour of Indore!\nVisit landmark places like Rajwada and Lal Bagh Palace. Also, taste the local sweets.\nNow, you\u2019ll be driven back to the Indore Airport /Railway Station from where you can continue your further journey.\nPlaces You\u2019ll See"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
  },
  "ujjain-tour-packages-from-ahmedabad": {
    "overview": "",
    "highlights": [
      "Enjoy a comfortable Darshan at the Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga",
      "Attend the one-of-a-kind Bhasma Aarti at the shrine",
      "Scared visits to the temples like Harsiddhi Mata Temple, Bade Ganesh Mandir, ISKCON Temple, and Chintaman Ganesh Temple",
      "Enjoy the evening Aarti at the Ram Ghat. Enjoy the peaceful atmosphere at the banks of the river Kshipra",
      "Stay in quality hotels",
      "Exploration of the Kajal Rani Caves",
      "Discover the rich culture of Indore",
      "All meals will be provided (100% vegetarian)",
      "Enjoy a trip to the Omkareshwara temple, which is yet another sacred Jyotirlinga"
    ],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1: Arrival in Ujjain",
        "description": "Welcome to the holy city of Ujjain! You'll be taken on a sightseeing tour to the Ram Ghat. Attend the mesmerizing evening Aarti here."
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2: Full-Day Ujjain Sightseeing",
        "description": "Get up early and attend the Bhasma Aarti at Mahakaleshwar Temple. Later on, you'll be taken for a temple tour of Harsiddhi Temple, Bade Ganeshji Ka Mandir, Kal Bhairav Temple, and ISKCON Temple.\n\nExplore the local dishes here, which have a reputation for being delicious!"
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3: Ujjain Omkareshwar Tour and Departure",
        "description": "Enjoy hearty breakfast and then get ready for the Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga trip. Afterwards, head back towards Ahmedabad.\n\nBest Time to Visit Ujjain\n\nThe best time to visit Ujjain is from October to March. The weather is delightful and has a wintery charm, making it perfectly suitable for you to come here.\n\nYou can also come here in the summer months, but be wary of the hot weather. The temperature can easily cross 35 degrees Celsius during the daytime.\n\nTry coming here in the months of February/March when the holy festival of Maha Shivratri is celebrated. The grandeur is noteworthy, especially in the Mahakaleshwar temple.\n\nCost of Ujjain Travel Package from Ahmedabad\n\nThe cost of our Ujjain packages varies based on the trip type. Our budget Ujjain trip from Ahmedabad is of\nINR 6,500\n. You can also combine your trip with the other Jyotirlingas and go on an\nUjjain Omkareshwar Tour\n, which has a price of INR 27,500.\n\nIn these plans, your meals, accommodation, and transportation are fully taken care of by us!\n\nWhy Book the Ujjain Tour with My Quick Trippers?\n\nWe have been a leader in the travel industry for years now and have conducted a great many tours, especially pilgrimages. With our services, you get to enjoy top accommodation, timely meals, and dedicated transport. Whether you are a solo traveller or want the best Ujjain trip package from Ahmedabad for family, we provide it all! Call us now to go on a memorable trip of your life!"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": []
  },
