  "vietnam-tour-packages-from-delhi": {
    "overview": "",
    "highlights": [
      "North Vietnam- Witness the charm of Hanoi, Halong Bay and Ninh Binh and get amazing insights on the heritage and culture of Vietnam. From the majestic Ngoc Son Temple at the center of Hoi An Kiem Lake to adventures at the hidden caves of Sung Sot, the beauty of North Vietnam never fails to captivate the minds of travellers.",
      "South Vietnam- Explore the beauty of Ho ChinMinh and the vibrant Mekong Delta in South Vietnam. Ho Chi Minh is renowned for its beautiful skyscrapers, museums, and bustling markets. The Mekong Delta is famous for its vast rice paddies, stunning rivers, canals and orchards.",
      "Central Vietnam- Places like Hue, Da Nang, and Hoi An make Central Vietnam one of Vietnam's most sought-after tourist destinations. Explore the ancient Cu Chi tunnels and participate in the vibrant Lantern festival. You must ride a scenic boat through the beautiful, lush canals of the Mekong Delta and enjoy a staycation in a riverside village.",
      "Cambodia-Located to the east of Vietnam, Cambodia is an enchanting paradise for travellers who love a perfect blend of history, culture and nature. Explore the awe-inspiring Angkor Wat, beautiful beaches and islands like Sihanoukville, Koh Rong, and Tonle Sap Lake.",
      "Fansipan Mountain- Perfect for adventurers who love trekking, Fansipan Mountain is the highest peak in Vietnam. It offers fantastic views of green forests, making it a perfect spot for nature photography."
    ],
    "itinerary": [],
    "faqs": []
  },
