  "wonders-of-kumaon-tour": {
    "overview": "Nestled comfortably on the lap of the sacred Nanda Devi range, the entire Kumaon is one of the most blissful and enchanting destinations in India. My Quick Trippers presents you with an opportunity to explore some of the awe-inspiring wonders of Kumaon with an 8 days and 7 nights of wonders of Kumaon tour package where you will be taken across some of the most enthralling locations in this hilly region.\n\nWonders of Kumaon Tour Itinerary Package\n\n\nDay 1 :Arrival in Delhi \u2013 Corbett\n\n\nYou will be welcomed in Delhi where our tour representative will transfer you to Corbett after covering a 7 hours of road journey. You will then be taken to your allotted hotel where you will be checked in for the night. Later you will also be made to visit Garjiya Devi mandir after which you will return back to your hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 2 :Corbett Sightseeing\n\n\nYou will be taken on a thrilling morning time jeep safari of this beautiful national park which is home to numerous species of flora and fauna. After having a fun day out in the wild, the evening time will be free for your leisure activities.\nThings to keep in mind while at a national park:\n\nDo not bring anything that will turn to waste, especially plastic materials.\nDo not be loud, which will diminish your chances of sighting any animals.\nAlcohol consumption within the park premises or entering the park while inebriated in not allowed under any circumstances.\n\n\n\n\n\nDay 3 :Corbett \u2013 Ranikhet\n\n\nEarly in the morning after breakfast, you will be transferred to the queen\u2019s land of Ranikhet. After covering a distance of 6 hours and getting checked in to your allotted hotel. The evening time will be free for you to explore the gorgeous hamlet on foot. You will be staying overnight at your hotel.\n\n\n\n\nDay 4 :Ranikhet \u2013 Kausani\n\n\nPost breakfast you will be taken on a half day of sightseeing expedition of Ranikhet which will include mesmerizing sites of Chaubatia \u2013 a cantonment hill station filled with natural scenic beauty; jhoola devi mandir \u2013 dedicated to goddess Jhula devi and featuring innumerable temple bells; ram mandir \u2013 which is located near Jhula Devi Temple and one of the most popular Hindu temples in Ranikhet.\nYou will then commence your journey towards one of the most pristine hill stations of northern India of Kausani. This hamlet sitting on the lap of the mighty Himalayan ranges is also one of the best honeymoon destinations in India.\nYou will immediately be checked in to your allotted hotel here for the night.\n\n\n\n\nDay 5 :Kausani \u2013 Baijnath \u2013 Kausani\n\n\nAfter witnessing the glorious sunrise over the snow peaked Himalayan Mountain range you will be returned to your hotel for breakfast after which you will be made to visit the famous Baijnath temple \u2013 an ancient temple dedicated to the Hindu goddess Parvati (Lord Shiva\u2019s consort). After paying your respects to the goddess you will be driven back to Kausani for staying the night.\n\n\n\n\nDay 6 :Kausani \u2013 Nainital\n\n\nYou will be leaving for Nainital after finishing your breakfast. This journey will be of 3 hours and 40 mines by road, where upon arrival and after getting checked in to your allotted hotel here, you will be free to explore this teeming and refreshing hill town on your own. You can stroll along the roads of Mall Road and buy souvenirs like, local paintings, scented candles, homemade chocolates, truffles, locally produced organic fruits and so much more. You can also choose to walk by the shimmering blue lake of Naini where you can enjoy the calming boat ride.\n\n\n\n\nDay 7 :Nainital Sightseeing\n\n\nThe entire day today will be free for you to explore the tourist spots in Nainital which are well known all over the world. You have the option of going on a lake tour of nearby places like, Bhimtal, Sattal, Naukuchiatal in order to explore the real beauty of nature in all its vigor.\n\nNainital to Bhimtal \u2013 50 mines.\nNainital to Sattal \u2013 1 hour 30 mines.\nNainital to Naukuchiatal \u2013 40 mines.\n\n\n\n\n\nDay 8 :Nainital \u2013 Delhi (Departure)\n\n\nAfter having your breakfast you will be made to depart for Delhi where you will be transferred to Delhi airport from where you will commence your journey onwards.",
    "highlights": [],
    "itinerary": [
      {
        "title": "Day 1 :Arrival in Delhi \u2013 Corbett",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 2 :Corbett Sightseeing",
        "description": ""
      },
      {
        "title": "Day 3 :Corbett \u2013 Ranikhet",
